icult to not have her father at the match.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/01/in-question-to-serena-williams-a-hint-of-sexism/', 'snippet': 'After her loss to Sabine Lisicki, Serena Williams was asked if it was difficult to not have her father at the match.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Serena Williams, it must have been a toss-up as to which she found more offensive: her fourth-round Wimbledon loss Monday to Sabine Lisicki or the fourth question in her post-match news conference, when she was asked if it was tough not having her father there to lend support.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Question to Serena Williams, a Hint of Sexism', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-01T20:29:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61bfa9c9-8fd3-5aed-8cb2-3a471779d5d7', 'word_count': 347, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61bfa9c9-8fd3-5aed-8cb2-3a471779d5d7'}, {'abstract': 'A letter to the editor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/02/science/more-on-archimedes.html', 'snippet': 'A letter to the editor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TO THE EDITOR: ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More on Archimedes', 'kicker': 'Letters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More On Archimedes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': '