 'A year after Raf Simons showed his first couture collection for Dior, he continues to shake up the fashion world. On Monday, Mr. Simons presented his most challenging collection to date.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/01/dior-letting-loose/', 'snippet': 'A year after Raf Simons showed his first couture collection for Dior, he continues to shake up the fashion world. On Monday, Mr. Simons presented his most challenging collection to date.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year after Raf Simons showed his first couture collection for Dior, he continues to shake up the fashion world. His impact is felt not just in Paris, but everywhere: in the simplifying of clothes, in modernist beadwork, in the variety of peplum jackets or bustiers worn with cigarette pants, in vivid colors that touch on nature and contemporary art.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dior: Letting Loose', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Couture (Fashion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Demarchelier, Patrick', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simons, Raf', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'West, Kanye', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Christian Dior SA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-01T20:50:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/270d5cc2-2f75-57