itics-and-repute.html', 'snippet': 'Senator Dianne Feinstein, a California Democrat, has dismayed many on the left by defending the National Security Agency’s surveillance programs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — She fought so hard to outlaw assault weapons that the National Rifle Association deemed her efforts tantamount to proposing the largest gun ban in American history. Well before the Supreme Court took up same-sex marriage, she sponsored a bill to repeal the Defense of Marriage Act. And she urged President George W. Bush, and later President Obama, to shut down the prison camp at Guantánamo Bay, Cuba.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/us/03FEINSTEIN/03FEINSTEIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/02/us/03FEINSTEIN/03FEINSTEIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/us/03FEINSTEIN/03FEINSTEIN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/us/03FEINSTEIN/03FEINSTEIN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1294, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/us/03FEINSTEIN/03FEINSTEIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/02/us/03FEINSTEIN/03FEINSTEIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/us/03FEINSTEIN/03FEINSTEIN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Feinstein’s Support for N.S.A. Defies Liberal Critics and Repute', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Support for N.S.A. Defies Liberal Critics and Repute', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peters, Jeremy W', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Feinstein, Dianne', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-01T23:44:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeremy W. Peters', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeremy', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Peters', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1fa246e7-0924-503d-8065-bd5093a670eb', 'word_count': 1159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1fa246e7-0924-503d-8065-bd5093a670eb'}, {'abstract': 'There is still no agreement to let N.H.L. players participate in the 2014 Olympics, but Commissioner Gary Bettman is confident one will be made.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/02/sports/hockey/nhl-nearing-olympics-deal.html', 'snippet': 'There is still no agreement to let N.H.L. players participate in the 2014 Olympics, but Commissioner Gary Bettman is confident one will be made.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A meeting in Manhattan that lasted more than five hours failed to produce an agreement to send N.H.L. players to the Sochi Olympics in February. The three principal parties, however, said they were confident a deal is within reach.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.H.L. Is Close to Making Olympic Deal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'N.H.L. Is Close to Making Olympic Deal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Jeff Z', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2014)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bettman, Gary', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-01T23:55:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d972456-3e1f-5a49-b37e-5f370b19ed36', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d972456-3e1f-5a49-b37e-5f370b19ed36'}, {'abstract': 'Qsymia, a weight-reduction drug, had sales of only $4 million in the first quarter. Its manufacturer is trying to jump-start acceptance of the drug.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/02/business/few-signs-of-a-taste-for-diet-pills.html', 'snippet': 'Qsymia, a weight-reduction drug, had sales of only $4 million in the first quarter. Its manufacturer is trying to jump-start acceptance of the drug.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Americans spend tens of billions of dollars each year to lose weight — gym memberships, Weight Watchers and other programs, operations, nutritional supplements and whatever the latest diet fad might be.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/business/DIET/DIET-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/02/business/DIET/DIET-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/business/DIET/DIET-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 434, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/business/DIET/DIET-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 867, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/business/DIET/DIET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/02/business/DIET/DIET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/business/DIET/DIET-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Few Signs of a Taste for Diet Pills', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Few Signs Of a Taste For Diet Pills', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollack, Andrew', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Obesity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N