ation': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4f6752a-548b-58ac-937d-027e3ab9657c', 'word_count': 461, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4f6752a-548b-58ac-937d-027e3ab9657c'}, {'abstract': 'A trip this spring to Singapore yielded Karl Lagerfeld’s theme for his fall Chanel couture show — “the old and new world,” he said.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/02/chanels-shimmering-city/', 'snippet': 'A trip this spring to Singapore yielded Karl Lagerfeld’s theme for his fall Chanel couture show — “the old and new world,” he said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A trip this spring to Singapore yielded Karl Lagerfeld’s theme for his fall Chanel couture show — “the old and new world,” he said. The old was represented as a crumbling theater (erected by Chanel stagehands in the Grand Palais) and the new as a galactic cityscape sparkling in the ruins.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chanel’s Shimmering City', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Couture (Fashion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lagerfeld, Karl', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chanel SA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Grand Palais', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-02T15:03:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a2de561-a44a-5810-9722-4ea5ae036b8d', 'word_count': 375, '