nail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/booming/02match-booming-beachboys-django/02match-booming-beachboys-django-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/02/booming/02match-booming-beachboys-django/02match-booming-beachboys-django-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/booming/02match-booming-beachboys-django/02match-booming-beachboys-django-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'If You Like the Beach Boys, Try Django Django', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baby Boomers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beach Boys', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Django Django', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surfing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'South by Southwest Music and Media Conference', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-02T16:42:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Booming', 'byline': {'original': 'By Val Haller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Val', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf949a9d-fddc-53bf-a96d-d624e3f0d79d', 'word_count': 466, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf949a9d-fddc-53bf-a96d-d624e3f0d79d'}, {'abstract': 'The Snapchat photo-sharing service is meant for those over 13, but many users are younger, and few will be satisfied with a neutered version of the app.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/02/are-your-children-using-snapchat/', 'snippet': 'The Snapchat photo-sharing service is meant for those over 13, but many users are younger, and few will be satisfied with a neutered version of the app.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If your children are the proud possessors of an iPhone, an iPod with a camera or an Android phone, they are probably aware of Snapchat, the app that allows users to send photos that disappear within a few seconds of viewing, whether they are using it or not. In theory, the app is limited to users over 13; in practice, “an overwhelming number of the 100 million photos shared every day are from teenagers and tweens,” Aimee Lee Ball writes in the Style section. Judging from Snapshat’s latest move, the creation of SnapKidz, the company hopes to bring ever-younger children gradually on board.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Are Your Children Using Snapchat?', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-02T16:43:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type