nytimes.com/2013/07/02/immigration-and-social-security/', 'snippet': 'Economists who have studied the issue tend to agree that more immigration is better for the Social Security system, at least for many years to come, but that the effect is small.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Social Security Administration says that the immigration bill passed by the Senate would help its coffers, adding $276 billion in revenue over the next 10 years while costing only $33 billion.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Immigration and Social Security', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Calculating the Effect On Social Security', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Workers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Security (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-02T21:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shaila Dewan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shaila', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dewan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33f30624-2365-5eeb-8ade-0678b215038f', 'word_count': 718, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33f30624-2365-5eeb-8ade-0678b215038f'}, {'abstract': 'Thousands descended on the Texas Capitol in Austin on Monday as Republican lawmakers looked to push through contentious abortion legislation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/100000002316167/protests-hit-special-session-in-texas-.html', 'snippet': 'Thousands descended on the Texas Capitol in Austin on Monday as Republican lawmakers looked to push through contentious abortion legislation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thousands descended on the Texas Capitol in Austin on Monday as Republican lawmakers looked to push through contentious abortion legislation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/us/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/02/us/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/us/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/02/us/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/02/us/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests/video-tc-tx-tribune-protests-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Protests Hit Special Session in Texas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-02T21:02:16+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/3f7ffe37-faca-5800-bb18-9a17791c5e41', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/3f7ffe37-faca-5800-bb18-9a17791c5e41'}, {'abstract': 'A vote by the European Parliament allows prosecutors in Lyon to proceed against Marine Le Pen, head of the National Front, on charges of violating laws against racial hatred.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/03/world/europe/french-far-right-leader-loses-parliamentary-immunity.html', 'snippet': 'A vote by the European Parliament allows prosecutors in Lyon to proceed against Marine Le Pen, head of the National Front, on charges of violating laws against racial hatred.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The European Parliament voted on Tuesday to lift parliamentary immunity for Marine Le Pen, the leader of the French National Front, a far-right party, which will allow prosecutors in Lyon to proceed against her on charges of violating laws against racial hatred.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'French Far-Right Leader Loses Parliamentary Immunity', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Europe', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'France: No More Immunity For a Far-Right Politician', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Le Pen, Marine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erlanger, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-02T21:07:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Erlanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/6fc5ae27-435b-586f-aad0-6876d0a15047', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6fc5ae27-435b-586f-aad0-6876d0a15047'}, {'abstract': 'In his memoir “For a Song and a Hundred Songs,” the poet Liao Yiwu describes torture and starvation in China’s system of “reform through labor.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/03/books/liao-yiwus-for-a-song-and-a-hundred-songs.html', 'snippet': 'In his memoir “For a Song and a Hundred Songs,” the poet Liao Yiwu describes torture and starvation in China’s system of “reform through labor.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Unlike the Russian acronym “gulag,” the Chinese word “laogai” has not been incorporated into English, although the system of “reform through labor” that it describes functions on a far larger scale than the Soviet camps did and continues to thrive. So even if Liao Yiwu’s memoir of his time as a prisoner in that system were a dry recitation of statistics, it would be performing a necessary service.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03BOOK/03BOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 910, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03BOOK/03BOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 910}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03BOOK/03BOOK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 676, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03BOOK/03BOOK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1351, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'su