s closing the company’s season at the Metropolitan Opera House.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All performing arts companies have their contradictions, but those that American Ballet Theater demonstrates in its big annual seasons at the Metropolitan Opera House are larger and more fundamental than most. Is this one of the world’s great companies? For its devotees, yes. Often they find it the greatest, principally because of its stellar assortment of international leading dancers. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/sleepingbeauty/sleepingbeauty-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/sleepingbeauty/sleepingbeauty-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/sleepingbeauty/sleepingbeauty-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/sleepingbeauty/sleepingbeauty-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1242, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/sleepingbeauty/sleepingbeauty-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/sleepingbeauty/sleepingbeauty-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/sleepingbeauty/sleepingbeauty-thumbLarg