ani-priv/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the couture fashion week photo diary of Alfredo Piola.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scenes from the couture fashion week photo diary of Alfredo Piola.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris Couture Fashion Week: Armani Privé Fall 2013', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Armani, Giorgio, SpA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-02T22:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alfredo Piola', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alfredo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piola', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9d65e4d-586d-593e-89f5-bc303d82d73d', 'word_count': 16, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9d65e4d-586d-593e-89f5-bc303d82d73d'}, {'abstract': 'Drew DeNicola and Olivia Mori’s documentary is a homage to the 1970s group Big Star.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/03/movies/big-star-nothing-can-hurt-me-is-tribute-to-a-70s-group.html', 'snippet': 'Drew DeNicola and Olivia Mori’s documentary is a homage to the 1970s group Big Star.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Forty years ago a mob of rock critics gathered for a convention cooked up by a promoter for the Memphis band Big Star, which played a praised set. That image of a cherished, practically mythic concert for an adoring and grateful few helps lay down the mood for “Big Star: Nothing Can Hurt Me.” A well-sourced account of a perfect, broken dream, Drew DeNicola and Olivia Mori’s slightly shaggy documentary captures what it’s like to discover music so good it seems as if it were made just for you.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03FILMROUNDUP2/03FILMROUNDUP2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03FILMROUNDUP2/03FILMROUNDUP2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 352}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03FILMROUNDUP2/03FILMROUNDUP2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03FILMROUNDUP2/03FILMROUNDUP2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03FILMROUNDUP2/03FILMROUNDUP2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03FILMROUNDUP2/03FILMROUNDUP2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/03/arts/03FILMROUNDUP2/03FILMROUNDUP2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Stillborn Band’s Rock Is Rediscovered', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'D