rt-says-airport-x-ray-scanners-pose-little-risk/', 'snippet': 'A new report concludes that passengers absorb little radiation from X-ray backscatter scanners.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Travelers often worry about radiation exposure from airport scanners, but a new report says that the risk is actually low: passengers absorb less radiation from airport X-ray backscatter scanners than they do while standing in line waiting for the scan itself.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Report Says Airport X-Ray Scanners Pose Little Risk', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radiation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'X-Rays', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transportation Security Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of California, Los Angeles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-03T16:28:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tanya Mohn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tanya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mohn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cba6b13c-3777-519f-959a-bc9e7b51df1e', 'word_count': 215, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cba6b13c-3777-519f-959a-bc9e7b51df1e'}, {'abstract': 'The Caledonia Scottish Pub, a popular spot on the Upper East Side, has a spacious new branch in Williamsburg called Isle of Skye, serving more than 100 different kinds of whiskey.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/04/fashion/isle-of-skye-in-williamsburg.html', 'snippet': 'The Caledonia Scottish Pub, a popular spot on the Upper East Side, has a spacious new branch in Williamsburg called Isle of Skye, serving more than 100 different kinds of whiskey.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Caledonia Scottish Pub, a popular spot on the Upper East Side, has a spacious new branch in Williamsburg called Isle of Skye, serving more than 100 different kinds of whiskey. A thick black binder lists them by region and price, along with some dramatic descriptions. In addition to the usual “peaty” and “smoky” adjectives, some whiskeys are “sweet with iodine and heather” or described as having hints of “poached peaches” and “smoked meats.”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/fashion/04BOITE/04zBOITE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/04/fashion/04BOITE/04zBOITE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/fashion/04BOITE/04zBOITE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/fashion/04BOITE/04zBOITE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/fashion/04BOITE/04zBOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/04/fashion/04BOITE/04zBOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None,