nt': 558, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8983f07-48c1-5e38-9264-6968f1e8a094'}, {'abstract': 'Yevgeny R. Urlashov, the popular mayor of Yaroslavl, was charged with bribery and extortion in a case that immediately set off accusations of Kremlin intimidation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/04/world/europe/russian-mayor-an-opposition-figure-is-arrested.html', 'snippet': 'Yevgeny R. Urlashov, the popular mayor of Yaroslavl, was charged with bribery and extortion in a case that immediately set off accusations of Kremlin intimidation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — The popular mayor of Yaroslavl, an anticorruption activist who is one of the few opposition figures in Russia to hold a major public office, was arrested late Tuesday and charged with bribery and extortion in a case that immediately set off accusations against the Kremlin of political intimidation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/world/europe/04russia/04russia-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 918, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/04/world/europe/04russia/04russia-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 918}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/world/europe/04russia/04russia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 670, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/world/europe/04russia/04russia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1339, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/world/europe/04russia/04russia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height