'nyt://article/1b0571aa-75ed-51af-89d3-1f3f276f73cd'}, {'abstract': 'The playwright-director duo of Wallace Shawn and André Gregory on their 40-year collaboration and the pleasures and benefits of rehearsing a play for a really long time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/07/theater/wallace-shawn-and-andre-gregory-on-their-long-collaboration.html', 'snippet': 'The playwright-director duo of Wallace Shawn and André Gregory on their 40-year collaboration and the pleasures and benefits of rehearsing a play for a really long time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wallace Shawn and André Gregory may be the most renowned playwright-director duo in New York theater, so much so that two of the city’s most renowned theaters, the Public and Theater for a New Audience, are sponsoring a series to celebrate their 40-year collaboration. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/arts/07GREGORY_SPAN/07GREGORY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/07/arts/07GREGORY_SPAN/07GREGORY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/arts/07GREGORY_SPAN/07GREGORY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/arts/07GREGORY_SPAN/07GREGORY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/arts/07GREGORY_SPAN/07GREGORY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnai