-07-04T02:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/09dbef59-958a-5461-9349-bec4807dca39', 'word_count': 268, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09dbef59-958a-5461-9349-bec4807dca39'}, {'abstract': 'A Texas brigade’s grand journey to the battlefields of Pennsylvania.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/03/john-bell-hoods-great-adventure/', 'snippet': 'A Texas brigade’s grand journey to the battlefields of Pennsylvania.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Texans arrived after a grueling overnight march. As the sun rose on south-central Pennsylvania on the morning of July 2, 1863, they were ordered to a creek called Willoughby Run, west of the small town of Gettysburg, where water would be plentiful for a short breakfast before they were to take their battle positions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'John Bell Hood’s Great Adventure', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gettysburg (Pa)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-04T02:00:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dffa2304-b96f-5a94-a862-a6d37af86052', 'word_count': 1691, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dffa2304-b96f-5a94-a862-a6d37af86052'}, {'abstract': 'I’m back to my column after a five-month book leave, and I invite you to comment here on the stalled efforts to reduce gun violence.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/03/im-back-from-book-leave-2/', 'snippet': 'I’m back to my column after a five-month book leave, and I invite you to comment here on the stalled efforts to reduce gun violence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m back to my column, after a five month book leave, and will again be writing every Thursday and Sunday in The Times. I’m actually physically in Mali, West Africa, as I type this, on my annual win-a-trip journey with a student (stay tuned for my Sunday column from Timbuktu). But my first column after my return was written as I was traveling here, and it reflects the enormous frustration I felt on my leave as I saw political momentum on addressing guns collapse.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'I’m Back From Book Leave!', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-04T02:00:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kristof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kristof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39831528-e2f2-5bb0-9697-2fcf60a4e2fc', 'word_count': 136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39831528-e2f2-5bb0-9697-2fcf60a4e2fc'}, {'abstract': 'Shaun Marcum’s tough season continued as the shoulder and neck tightness that plagued him during spring training returned.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/04/sports/baseball/mets-marcum-is-bothered-again-by-his-shoulder-and-neck.html', 'snippet': 'Shaun Marcum’s tough season continued as the shoulder and neck tightness that plagued him during spring training returned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shaun Marcum has experienced a recurrence of the shoulder and neck tightness that plagued him during spring training and forced him to the disabled list at the start of the season, Mets Manager Terry Collins said Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/baseball/04citifield1-img/04citifield1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/baseball/04citifield1-img/04citifield1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/baseball/04citifield1-img/04citifield1-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/baseball/04citifield1-img/04citifield1-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1462, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/baseball/04citifield1-img/04citifield1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/baseball/04citifield1-img/04citifield1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/baseball/04citifield1-img/04citifield1-img-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'leg