thia-continue-mastery-of-twins.html', 'snippet': 'C. C. Sabathia required 121 pitches to get through seven innings, but he still earned his 200th win as the Yankees came from two runs down to beat the Twins.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — His arm slot was inconsistent, his command was suspect, and he required 121 pitches just to get through seven innings. Perhaps, though, it was the most fitting way for C. C. Sabathia to reach a significant milestone.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-YANKS-1/CITY-YANKS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-YANKS-1/CITY-YANKS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-YANKS-1/CITY-YANKS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-YANKS-1/CITY-YANKS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-YANKS-1/CITY-YANKS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-YANKS-1/CITY-YANKS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-YANKS-1/CITY-YANKS-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width