layers they had been hoping to sign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If the Knicks and the Nets are stymied in their free-agent pursuits this summer, if they reach opening night without a viable sixth man or a 3-point shooting ace, they can blame J. J. Redick. If they want to be fair, they can blame Kevin Martin and Martell Webster, too.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Knicks and Nets’ Plans Complicated by Suddenly Expensive Wing Players', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wing Players, Suddenly Expensive, Complicate Knicks’ and Nets’ Plans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beck, Howard', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Nets', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Redick, J J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Kevin', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Korver, Kyle', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, J R', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-04T03:50:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Howard Beck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Howard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Beck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8f0596b-2468-52ae-b52e-05a1085bbc4a', 'word_count': 812, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8f0596b-2468-52ae-b52e-05a1085bbc4a'}, {'abstract': 'Economic espionage against friendly governments sows mistrust, and usually is just a waste of time and resources, two economists write.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/04/an-economic-primer-for-spies/', 'snippet': 'Economic espionage against friendly governments sows mistrust, and usually is just a waste of time and resources, two economists write.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Peter Boone is chairman of the charity Effective Intervention and a research associate at the Center for Economic Performance at the London School of Economics. He is also a director of Salute Capital Management Ltd. Simon Johnson is a professor at the M.I.T. Sloan School of Management and former chief economist at the International Monetary Fund.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Economic Primer for Spies', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-04T04:01:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Boone and Simon Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Boone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b7cbb8d-0e5d-5c84-b4b8-958ab7323448', 'word_count': 874, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b7cbb8d-0e5d-5c84-b4b8-958ab7323448'}, {'abstract': 'It’s our job, as doctors and nurses, to be deliberate in asking our patients how they will explain their cancer to others, to make sure they understand. Keeping such a diagnosis hushed, from those who love and care for us, is an unfair burden we shouldn’t allow cancer to dictate, too.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/04/keeping-cancer-a-secret/', 'snippet': 'It’s our job, as doctors and nurses, to be deliberate in asking our patients how they will explain their cancer to others, to make sure they understand. Keeping such a diagnosis hushed, from those who love and care for us, is an unfair burden we s...', 'lead_paragraph': 'My patient came to see me every six months or so with his wife of 40 years, making the five-hour drive from West Virginia, where he managed a few businesses. He had myelodysplastic syndrome, a type of bone marrow cancer that in his case was indolent, requiring only regular shots with a hormone, but no chemotherapy – yet. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/health/04well_secret/04well_secret-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 465, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/04/health/04well_secret/04well_secret-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 465}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/health/04well_secret/04well_secret-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 794, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/health/04well_secret/04well_secret-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1589, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/health/04well_secret/04well_secret-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/04/health/04well_secret/04well_secret-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/health/04well_secret/04well_secret-t