r’s fonts? While third-party tools like FontStruct and BitFont Maker 2 allow you to design and create your own characters, PC users can tap right into the Private Character Editor utility that comes with most recent versions of Windows.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tip of the Week: Use the Windows Private Character Editor', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tip of The Week', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Software', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-04T05:55:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J.d. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3dc8fce4-3e58-5acc-9e8e-8f10915cf69c', 'word_count': 168, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3dc8fce4-3e58-5acc-9e8e-8f10915cf69c'}, {'abstract': 'The designers Maria Grazia Chiuri and Pierpaolo Piccioli said they wanted to evoke a room of curiosities, as well as a sense of wonder, in the Valentino fall couture show.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/04/valentino-lady-in-the-attic/', 'snippet': 'The designers Maria Grazia Chiuri and Pierpaolo Piccioli said they wanted to evoke a room of curiosities, as well as a sense of wonder, in the Valentino fall couture show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s an interesting number: 3,000 meters of silver thread and 4,600 crystal rosettes were used to embroider a floor-length tweed cape and organza dress in the Valentino fall couture show. Without question the designers Maria Grazia Chiuri and Pierpaolo Piccioli created something spectacular with this cape, which had a wide band of black around the shoulders that helped to set off all that silver. Despite the whopping thread count, the cape had a lovely economy. Well, it was the tweed, the imaginative addition of the black band, and those austere lines.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Valentino: Lady in the Attic', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Couture (Fashion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chiuri, Maria Grazia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Piccioli, Pierpaolo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-04T07:03:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb2876b1-fa95-5e44-8f63-4d3bbaa6f028', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb2876b1-fa95-5e44-8f63-4d3bbaa6f028'}, {'abstract': 'Katrina Capasso feeds her llamas at the Dakota Ridge Farm in Ballston Spa, N.Y.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/100000002319568/llama-mama.html', 'snippet': 'Katrina Capasso feeds her llamas at the Dakota Ridge Farm in Ballston Spa, N.Y.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Katrina Capasso feeds her llamas at the Dakota Ridge Farm in Ballston Spa, N.Y.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/04/us/video-llama-pets/video-llama-pets-articleLarge.jpg', 'hei