o helped uncover wrongdoing by the New York police decades ago, is at odds with a neighbor over property overlooking the Hudson.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/05/nyregion/for-serpico-who-fought-police-corruption-a-new-conflict-over-woodland.html', 'snippet': 'Frank Serpico, who helped uncover wrongdoing by the New York police decades ago, is at odds with a neighbor over property overlooking the Hudson.', 'lead_paragraph': 'STUYVESANT, N.Y. — Frank Serpico stopped along a road near his home in this Hudson River town, picked up a dead bird, gently placed it on a steel guardrail and laid a wildflower on the bird’s breast.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/nyregion/05serpico-web/05serpico-web-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/05/nyregion/05serpico-web/05serpico-web-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/nyregion/05serpico-web/05serpico-web-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 577, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/nyregion/05serpico-web/05serpico-web-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1154, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/nyregion/05serpico-web/05serpico-web-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/05/nyregion/05serpico-web/05serpico-web-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbn