n Franzen, although Mr. Franzen would probably cringe at the comparison. Behind his designer glasses, the fashionably scruffy Bill wears a quizzical expression that signals the bemusement of a middle-aged man sadly watching the world go by. Every phrase out of his mouth is tinged with irony.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05STUCK_SPAN/05STUCK_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05STUCK_SPAN/05STUCK_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 349}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05STUCK_SPAN/05STUCK_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 596, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05STUCK_SPAN/05STUCK_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1193, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05STUCK_SPAN/05STUCK_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05STUCK_SPAN/05STUCK_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05STUCK_SPAN/05STUCK_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Unable to Move On, as a Writer or a Lover', 'kicker': 'Movie Re