th Grand Slam title overall.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bryan Twins Head Into Final on a Roll', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'American Doubles Team Chases a Feat Not Accomplished Since 1988', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wimbledon Tennis Tournament', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bryan, Bob', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bryan, Mike', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-04T21:19:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6cd41bce-ab34-5ae0-8fc4-76918ec6e715', 'word_count': 791, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6cd41bce-ab34-5ae0-8fc4-76918ec6e715'}, {'abstract': 'Two former New Yorkers opened this low-key spot last fall, serving thin-crust pizzas and incorporating local ingredients.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/07/travel/restaurant-report-onlywood-pizzeria-trattoria-in-key-west.html', 'snippet': 'Two former New Yorkers opened this low-key spot last fall, serving thin-crust pizzas and incorporating local ingredients.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Duval Street, with its brusque drag queens, blaring music and inebriated swarms, may be the version of Key West, Fla., seared into the minds of many visitors. But just steps away from this mayhem, on a tiny half-street tightly wedged between two buildings, is a restaurant whose food and story have charmed locals since its October opening.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': 