rticle/7c8a60eb-5ee0-5538-b124-3865fe3ccbb7'}, {'abstract': 'The New York Philharmonic, led by Bramwell Tovey, performed a patriotic program on Wednesday at Avery Fisher Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/05/arts/music/military-brass-civilian-strings.html', 'snippet': 'The New York Philharmonic, led by Bramwell Tovey, performed a patriotic program on Wednesday at Avery Fisher Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Wednesday, just four days after the conductor Alan Gilbert ended the New York Philharmonic’s regular season with “A Dancer’s Dream,” an ambitious program featuring inventive staged productions of two Stravinsky ballets, the orchestra returned to Avery Fisher Hall for the first of two Summertime Classics programs, its series offering lighter fare. The British conductor Bramwell Tovey has become the host of choice for these popular concerts, winning over audiences with his lively performances and avuncular humor.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05SUMMER1_SPAN/SUMMER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 245, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05SUMMER1_SPAN/SUMMER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 245}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05SUMMER1_SPAN/SUMMER-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05SUMMER1_SPAN/SUMMER-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 835, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07