rass of the Elevated Acre in Lower Manhattan. This site-specific dance exposed them to the elements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Wednesday afternoon, the celebrated dancers Silas Riener and Rashaun Mitchell gathered with their colleague Cori Kresge on the grass of the Elevated Acre in Lower Manhattan. They were there to perform “Reveal,” a site-specific dance. And one thing somewhat specific about the site, a terrace framed by skyscrapers and overlooking the East River, is its exposure to the elements. On a blustery Wednesday, the elements cooperated, perhaps too much.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05MITCHELL_SPAN/MITCHELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05MITCHELL_SPAN/MITCHELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05MITCHELL_SPAN/MITCHELL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05MITCHELL_SPAN/MITCHELL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05MITCHELL_SPAN/MITCHELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/05/arts/05MITCHELL_SPAN/MITCHELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url