in a rehabilitation assignment in Class AAA.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/06/sports/baseball/yankees-jeter-orioles.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees scored twice in the ninth to beat the Orioles on Friday, after learning Derek Jeter would begin a rehabilitation assignment in Class AAA.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Yankees came home Friday to open an important weekend series against a division rival, the Baltimore Orioles. But in what has become a ritual this season, the focus before the game was on rehabilitating veterans who will be in various parts of the United States this weekend, but not in the Bronx.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'su