ies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/06/world/snowden.html', 'snippet': 'President Nicolás Maduro of Venezuela announced his decision regarding Edward J. Snowden, the former N.S.A. contractor, after Mr. Snowden was turned down by several countries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Nicolás Maduro of Venezuela said Friday that he would offer asylum to the fugitive intelligence contractor Edward J. Snowden, who has been stranded in a Moscow airport searching for a safe haven. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Venezuela Offers Asylum to Snowden', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Venezuela Offers Asylum to N.S.A. Leaker', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Asylum, Right of', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maduro, Nicolas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ortega, Daniel', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nicaragua', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-05T22:50:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Neuman and David M. Herszenhorn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neuman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d78aaf79-33da-5059-8ceb-6d3245531165', 'word_count': 530, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d78aaf79-33da-5059-8ceb-6d3245531165'}, {'abstract': 'In a sophisticated atmosphere, Lola’s Mexican Kitchen, in White Plains, offers cooking to suit adult tastes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/07/nyregion/a-review-of-lolas-mexican-kitchen-in-white-plains.html', 'snippet': 'In a sophisticated atmosphere, Lola’s Mexican Kitchen, in White Plains, offers cooking to suit adult tastes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just a few years back it was a struggle to find good Mexican food in Westchester County. Today, while the cuisine still is not ubiquitous, there are strong choices — from takeout taquerias to casual family restaurants to sophisticated spots that go way beyond enchiladas and burritos.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/nyregion/07DINEWE2/07DINEWE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 798, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/07/nyregion/07DINEWE2/07DINEWE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 798}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/nyregion/07DINEWE2/07DINEWE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 770, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/nyregion/07DINEWE2/07DINEWE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1540, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/nyregion/07DINEWE2/07DINEWE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'i