e at the agency knew fully what they were doing. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The C.I.A. and the N.Y.P.D.', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The C.I.A. and the N.Y.P.D.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Intelligence Agency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'September 11 (2001)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-06T00:54:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/a71f97f2-5155-500f-a116-eec819bb8ffd', 'word_count': 315, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a71f97f2-5155-500f-a116-eec819bb8ffd'}, {'abstract': 'The romantic comedy “As You Like It” is staged outdoors in Morris Township, mosquitoes and all.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/07/nyregion/a-review-of-as-you-like-it-at-college-of-st-elizabeth.html', 'snippet': 'The romantic comedy “As You Like It” is staged outdoors in Morris Township, mosquitoes and all.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALL THE RAINY WEATHER of late has made for lush greenery surrounding the Greek Theater at the College of St. Elizabeth in Morris Township, where the Shakespeare Theater of New Jersey is offering an agreeable outdoor production of “As You Like It.” (And the mosquitoes on a recent night were ou