/interactive/81660fe6-db78-502a-a6b0-ad00a84b442e'}, {'abstract': 'Chris Davis, a star this season who arrived for a series in the Bronx with 32 homers, has no regrets about turning down the Yankees after the 2004 amateur draft, he said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/06/sports/baseball/davis-drafted-by-yankees-breaks-out-with-orioles.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Davis, a star this season who arrived for a series in the Bronx with 32 homers, has no regrets about turning down the Yankees after the 2004 amateur draft, he said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There were 1,498 players picked in the 2004 amateur draft. The 1,496th was a high school slugger from Longview, Tex., named Chris Davis. The Yankees used their 50th-round choice that summer on Davis, just in case he changed his mind about attending the University of Texas.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1329, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/06/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSt