.com/2013/07/07/sports/baseball/a-popular-reds-owner-its-about-time.html', 'snippet': 'After years of suffering because of the Reds owners Marge Schott and Carl Lindner, the team’s current boss, Bob Castellini, has given fans something to cheer about.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some fans never get to choose their favorite baseball team, and that means they never get to choose their favorite team’s owner. My father grew up in southern Indiana, rooting for the squad on the other side of the Ohio border, the Cincinnati Reds. My mother grew up in a suburb of Cincinnati, convinced she would one day marry Johnny Bench.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/sports/reds1/reds1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/07/sports/reds1/reds1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/sports/reds1/reds1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/sports/reds1/reds1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1241, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/sports/reds1/reds1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/07/sports/reds1/reds1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/sports/reds1/reds1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Popular Reds Owner (It’s About Time)', 'kicker': 'Essay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Popular Reds Owner (It’s About Time)', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cincinnati Reds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schott, Marge', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Castellini, Bob', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-06T15:24:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Craig Fehrman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Craig', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fehrman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b1d18241-c9cd-5033-baf0-23307d4c5745', 'word_count': 1003, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b1d18241-c9cd-5033-baf0-23307d4c5745'}, {'abstract': 'Baseball tries hard to convince fans that the All-Star Game is all about effort. But mainly, players come to enjoy the spectacle and revel in their status as the best of the best.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/07/sports/baseball/all-star-wonder-is-not-all-fun-and-games.html', 'snippet': 'Baseball tries hard to convince fans that the All-Star Game is all about effort. But mainly, players come to enjoy the spectacle and revel in their status as the best of the best.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Justin Verlander squirmed in his chair at the AT&T Park interview room Oct. 23. He was there to talk about his assignment the next night in Game 1 of the World Series. He did not want to rehash his poor start in the All-Star Game, which was a big reason his Detroit Tigers were openin