ormer business partner of Magic Johnson advises business school students to be “hungrier than you’ve ever been” after graduation, because competition will be intense.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/07/business/ken-lombard-on-staying-a-student-of-business.html', 'snippet': 'The former business partner of Magic Johnson advises business school students to be “hungrier than you’ve ever been” after graduation, because competition will be intense.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This interview with  Ken Lombard, partner at Capri Capital Partners, a real estate investment and development firm, was conducted and condensed by  Adam Bryant.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07--CORNER/07--CORNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 916, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07--CORNER/07--CORNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 916}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07--CORNER/07--CORNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 671, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07--CORNER/07--CORNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1342, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07--CORNER/07--CORNER-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07--CORNER/07--CORNER-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'