powerhouse over the last decade, has recently turned much lower.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/07/business/mutfund/in-brazil-a-reminder-of-emerging-market-risks.html', 'snippet': 'Brazil has seen its economic growth slow, while protests have flared nationwide. And its stock market, a powerhouse over the last decade, has recently turned much lower.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE protests in Brazil last month were the latest vivid reminder of the perils of investing in emerging markets. Tens of thousands of demonstrators thronged the streets of São Paulo, Rio de Janeiro and other cities, incited partly by a rising cost of living and a slowing economy. Cars burned. Tear gas billowed. And the Brazilian stock market sank. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07-LATIN-JP2SUB/07-LATIN-JP2SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 607, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07-LATIN-JP2SUB/07-LATIN-JP2SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 607}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07-LATIN-JP2SUB/07-LATIN-JP2SUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1012, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07-LATIN-JP2SUB/07-LATIN-JP2SUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/business/07-LATIN-JP2SUB/07-LATIN-JP2SUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy