 'Driving gave me a license to perpetrate all manner of pranks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/07/opinion/sunday/trouble-on-wheels.html', 'snippet': 'Driving gave me a license to perpetrate all manner of pranks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT was after midnight, the summer of 2002, and I had just casually placed a hundred eggs and a pineapple in front of the register at a 24-hour grocery in metro Atlanta. The eggs were for throwing at houses. The pineapple was for throwing off the cashier. A hundred eggs by themselves lead one to suspect impending delinquency. Add in a pineapple and all one suspects is an interesting omelet.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/opinion/07driving-img3/07driving-img3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/07/opinion/07driving-img3/07driving-img3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/opinion/07driving-img3/07driving-img3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/opinion/07driving-img3/07driving-img3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/07/opinion/07driving-img3/07driving-img3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/07/opinion/07driving-img3/07driving-img3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75