dd to think about a Texas government without Rick Perry. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Perry’s World Will Go On, With or Without Him', 'kicker': 'Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Perry’s World Will Go On, With or Without Him', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-06T22:23:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Ramsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/690ea86e-a8e1-5adc-a006-2b2117a6176e', 'word_count': 756, 'uri': 'nyt://article/690ea86e-a8e1-5adc-a006-2b2117a6176e'}, {'abstract': 'Marion Bartoli used an uncomplicated style to defeat the nervous Sabine Lisicki, whose versatile game became a burden.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/06/why-keeping-it-simple-worked-for-bartoli/', 'snippet': 'Marion Bartoli used an uncomplicated style to defeat the nervous Sabine Lisicki, whose versatile game became a burden.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marion Bartoli swept through the Wimbledon fortnight without dropping a set. In the final Saturday, she used her superb return to blunt the powerful serve of Sabine Lisicki, but she also showed vastly improved court coverage, a willingness to attack the net and just enough variety in her shot selection to keep Lisicki off balance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Keeping It Simple Worked for Bartoli', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_ki