9a5321526583', 'word_count': 195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c08d4a15-541f-5a73-a716-9a5321526583'}, {'abstract': 'More than 200 images of Masood Hussain’s watercolors on Srinagar have set off long conversations about shared and separate memories of Kashmir.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/08/kashmiri-artist-builds-bridges-with-facebook-exhibit/', 'snippet': 'More than 200 images of Masood Hussain’s watercolors on Srinagar have set off long conversations about shared and separate memories of Kashmir.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four years ago, Masood Hussain, one of Kashmir’s most renowned artists, worked on a series of watercolors of places, people and activities in and around his city, Srinagar. Imbued with realistic touches, alive with filigree details, and emitting a translucence bequeathed by the medium in the hands of a master, the series “Transparent Strokes” was snapped up by visitors to the city. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kashmiri Artist Builds Bridges with Facebook Exhibit', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dal Lake (Jammu and Kashmir)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir and Jammu (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir Valley (Kashmir and Jammu)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-08T14:26:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chitra Padmanabhan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chitra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Padmanabhan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 