/b0488dd2-760c-5b1c-9b2f-ea7504f5847a'}, {'abstract': 'A pilot program that combines training, intervention and prevention at a Navy base in Illinois seems to have reduced the incidence of sexual assault.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/09/us/for-navy-recruits-basic-training-now-targets-sexual-assault.html', 'snippet': 'A pilot program that combines training, intervention and prevention at a Navy base in Illinois seems to have reduced the incidence of sexual assault.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NAVAL STATION GREAT LAKES, Ill. — On Day 3 of Navy boot camp here, recruits sat through a two-hour session on sexual harassment and sexual assault — including a warning that alcohol often plays a significant role, but is never a defense.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/09/us/09ASSAULT/09ASSAULT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/09/us/09ASSAULT/09ASSAULT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/09/us/09ASSAULT/09ASSAULT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 632, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/09/us/09ASSAULT/09ASSAULT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1263, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/09/us/09ASSAULT/09ASSAULT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/09/us/09ASSAULT/09ASSAULT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumb