 1044, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8fe3ead-ec1e-5565-b53d-3c16a76f6987'}, {'abstract': 'The New York Philharmonic will present a new staged production of “Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street,” Stephen Sondheim’s musical about a murderous hair-cutter, starring the bass-baritone Bryn Terfel in the title role.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/08/he-will-have-vengeance-again-new-york-philharmonic-to-present-sweeney-todd/', 'snippet': 'The New York Philharmonic will present a new staged production of “Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street,” Stephen Sondheim’s musical about a murderous hair-cutter, starring the bass-baritone Bryn Terfel in the title role.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sharpen your razor, protect your jugular vein and prepare to re-attend the tale of Sweeney Todd: The New York Philharmonic will present a new staged production in March of “Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street,” the dark and gory Stephen Sondheim-Hugh Wheeler musical about a murderous hair-cutter with a thirst for vengeance, it was announced on Monday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'He Will Have Vengeance (Again): New York Philharmonic to Present ‘Sweeney Todd’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Little Off the Top From the Philharmonic', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gilbert, Alan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Price, Lonny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sondheim, Stephen', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Terfel, Bryn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Philharmonic', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-08T19:25:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Da