ht by investors who lost $60 million in Bernie Madoff’s Ponzi scheme claims that Westport National Bank failed to protect their money.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/07/08/madoff-case-puts-focus-on-duties-of-custodial-banks/', 'snippet': 'A lawsuit brought by investors who lost $60 million in Bernie Madoff’s Ponzi scheme claims that Westport National Bank failed to protect their money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the far-flung feeder funds, brokerage houses and institutions interconnected in the vast Ponzi scheme perpetuated by Bernard L. Madoff, one little-known local bank is now in the spotlight.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Madoff Case Puts Focus on Duties of Custodial Banks', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Madoff Case Puts Focus on the Duties of Custodial Banks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ponzi and Pyramid Schemes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Madoff, Bernard L', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Madoff, Bernard L, Investment Securities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Westport National Bank', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-08T21:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Antilla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Antilla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc9ddf2e-77c7-5aa0-ab08-5cb593e22805', 'word_count': 1145, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc9ddf2e-77c7-5aa0-ab08-5cb593e22805'}, {'abstract': 'Mikhail Baryshnikov and Willem Dafoe star in “The Old Woman,