h Mr. Snowden to gauge his credibility. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Der Spiegel Publishes Portion of Snowden Vetting Interview', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-09T04:20:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Schwirtz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schwirtz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6c80312-1362-5c77-a2a9-966ed7a4a90c', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6c80312-1362-5c77-a2a9-966ed7a4a90c'}, {'abstract': 'As reports of sexual assault increase across the military, a naval base in Illinois has taken steps to lower the number of attacks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/07/08/us/A-Test-Case-for-Sexual-Assault-Prevention.html', 'snippet': 'As reports of sexual assault increase across the military, a naval base in Illinois has taken steps to lower the number of attacks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As reports of sexual assault increase across the military, a naval base in Illinois has taken steps to lower the number of attacks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/09/us/assault-graph-thumb/assault-graph-thumb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 577, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/09/us/assault-graph-thumb/assault-graph-thumb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 577, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit