while-you-charge-consumers-and-retailers-are-plugging-in/', 'snippet': 'Retailers have found that aside from improving company image, providing electric vehicle charging can lengthen a shopper’s stay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brian Wynne, president of the Electric Drive Transportation Association, recently drove his Chevrolet Volt to a dinner date with his wife at Stone’s Cove Kitbar in Herndon, Va. Nothing unusual about that, but Mr. Wynne was parked and on his way in when his wife pointed out that he could have plugged the Volt into the restaurant’s E.V. charger. It’s right out front.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/automobiles/wheels/retail-charging-IKEA/retail-charging-IKEA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/05/automobiles/wheels/retail-charging-IKEA/retail-charging-IKEA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/automobiles/wheels/retail-charging-IKEA/retail-charging-IKEA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/automobiles/wheels/retail-charging-IKEA/retail-charging-IKEA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1150, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/05/automobiles/wheels/retail-charging-IKEA/retail-charging-IKEA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/05/automobiles/wheels/retail-charging-IKEA/retail-charging-