ng-expected appointment of the aide, Ron Dermer, had raised concerns in Washington because of Mr. Dermer’s ties to Republicans, but he has since won over many in the White House.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/10/world/middleeast/netanyahu-names-key-adviser-as-ambassador-to-us.html', 'snippet': 'The long-expected appointment of the aide, Ron Dermer, had raised concerns in Washington because of Mr. Dermer’s ties to Republicans, but he has since won over many in the White House.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu on Tuesday named one of his closest advisers, Ron Dermer, to be Israel’s next ambassador to the United States, a long-anticipated pick that had raised some concern in Washington because of Mr. Dermer’s ties to Republicans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/world/0710ISRAEL/0710ISRAEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 387, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/world/0710ISRAEL/0710ISRAEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 387, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/world/0710ISRAEL/0710ISRAEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/10/world/0710ISRAEL/0710ISRAEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/world/0710ISRAEL/0710ISRAEL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], '