e daiquiri and margarita as serious cocktails.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Etan Fraiman and David Shapiro were envisioning Battery Harris, their new bar and restaurant in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, Mr. Fraiman hit upon the idea of installing a slushy machine to produce frozen drinks. What easier way to telegraph the idea that here was a fun place that didn’t take itself too seriously? ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/dining/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/10/dining/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 302}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/dining/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 516, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/dining/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1032, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/dining/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/10/dining/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/dining/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN/10SLUSH_SUBSPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cro