h': 'The commercial area of Riverhead sits at the spot where the North and South Forks of Long Island divide, which is why it is sometimes called the Gateway to the East End. For some visitors passing through, it is best known as the home of Tanger Outlets, a giant discount mall, and of a string of big-box stores that stretch east beyond it on Old Country Road. Others may also know its Main Street, a once run-down area now in the midst of a revival driven in part by a world-class aquarium and a refurbished Art Deco theater.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't