1caebf'}, {'abstract': 'White Columns, the Manhattan art gallery, offers fresh evidence of felines’ plans for global domination with an exhibition devoted to the species.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/09/artifacts-cats-the-new-rulers-of-the-art-world/', 'snippet': 'White Columns, the Manhattan art gallery, offers fresh evidence of felines’ plans for global domination with an exhibition devoted to the species.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When it comes to art, cats are like the second sex. What is the feline equivalent of Jeff Koons’s giant flowering “Puppy?” Where is the painting of a snarling tabby to counter Francis Bacon’s feral mutt? Are fluffy cats not worthy of the same serious treatment as Edwin Landseer’s regal hounds or David Hockney’s beloved pooches? Who is the William Wegman of the whisker set?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Artifacts | Cats, the New Rulers of the Art World', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-09T22:50:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Linda Yablonsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Linda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yablonsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39832905-fe18-555a-865f-84e5c404fc20', 'word_count': 640, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39832905-fe18-555a-865f-84e5c404fc20'}, {'abstract': 'Notable properties that have been recently listed for sale, sold or leased.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/10/business/recent-commercial-real-estate-transactions.html', 'snippet': 'Notable properties that have been recently listed for sale, sold or leased.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Recent Sale', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Time