_paragraph': 'Around Christine C. Quinn’s campaign headquarters, her father, Lawrence, an Irish-wisdom-collecting, tough-love-dispensing octogenarian, is known as her “not-so-secret weapon,” routinely trotted out (in his words) for union endorsements, veterans’ parades and visits to senior centers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quinn’s Father Is Sidelined', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quinn’s Father Is Sidelined', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Lawrence P', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-10T03:18:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/48c06820-c1f2-5669-ad69-514d3cf6faa9', 'word_count': 371, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48c06820-c1f2-5669-ad69-514d3cf6faa9'}, {'abstract': 'William C. Thompson Jr., a Democrat and former city comptroller, was endorsed by the Uniformed Firefighters Association on Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/10/nyregion/firefighters-union-backs-thompson.html', 'snippet': 'William C. Thompson Jr., a Democrat and former city comptroller, was endorsed by the Uniformed Firefighters Association on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Firehouses can be potent symbols in New York City politics, a perennial subject of budget fights that supply bragging rights for candidates who like to claim credit for preve