'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6bebb144-1b7c-5519-94e5-224597e7f5d3'}, {'abstract': 'There’s never been any doubt that pregnancy drastically changes a woman’s body: She gains weight, her center of gravity shifts and connective tissues become looser. But it also affects how a woman moves.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/10/how-pregnancy-changes-a-runners-body/', 'snippet': 'There’s never been any doubt that pregnancy drastically changes a woman’s body: She gains weight, her center of gravity shifts and connective tissues become looser. But it also affects how a woman moves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New research suggests that the biomechanical changes that occur during pregnancy can linger long afterward and significantly affect a woman’s running stride. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/health/10well_physed/10well_physed-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/10/health/10well_physed/10well_physed-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/health/10well_physed/10well_physed-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/health/10well_physed/10well_physed-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/10/health/10well_physed/10well_physed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'ima