https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/14/travel/frequent-flier-changes-for-better-or-worse.html', 'snippet': 'A number of recent changes to airline loyalty programs could affect your costs and benefits. Here’s how.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Change is in the air: Over the last few weeks a number of United States airlines — American, Delta, JetBlue, United — have announced new programs or modifications to existing programs that will have an impact on their frequent fliers. Some changes could be for the better (earning miles on partner airlines, converting hotel stays into airline miles, access to more lounges); others, not so much (higher award ticket fees, minimum annual spending requirements, disappearing bonuses). If you’re a member of an airline loyalty program, here’s what you need to know. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 485, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 485}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 828, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1657, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 