ed for the flight number of an airline the serves the Paris-Tokyo route. The JL406, for a Japan Airlines flight (above), is a Wayfarer shape with rocker appeal. Another, the rounded AF280, for Air France, is a 1960s shape, inspired by Yoko Ono. The glasses have acetate frames and photochromic lenses that darken in sunlight. And with the contrast colors on the brow line, they’re a fun midsummer pick-me-up.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Etnia Barcelona Gives its Aviator Sunglasses Flight Numbers', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New Take on Aviator Sunglasses', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sunglasses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-10T19:22:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By ERICA M. BLUMENTHAL', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ae016141-f063-5ed2-b8d4-26c1c218bbaf', 'word_count': 90, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae016141-f063-5ed2-b8d4-26c1c218bbaf'}, {'abstract': 'Close to finalizing the trade for Paul Pierce and Kevin Garnett, Nets General Manager Billy King likes his team’s prospects but has little cap room left.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/11/sports/basketball/nets-optimism-comes-at-a-price.html', 'snippet': 'Close to finalizing the trade for Paul Pierce and Kevin Garnett, Nets General Manager Billy King likes his team’s prospects but has little cap room left.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ORLANDO, Fla. — The names slipped out before Billy King could catch himself. “Kevin,” he said in passing. “Paul,” he said in his next breat