r, called a Democratic move to bar the minority party from filibustering presidential appointees a power grab.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/12/us/politics/showdown-nears-in-senate-over-filibusters-change.html', 'snippet': 'Senator Mitch McConnell of Kentucky, the Republican leader, called a Democratic move to bar the minority party from filibustering presidential appointees a power grab.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Senate on Thursday moved toward imposing historic limits on how the filibuster can be used as Senator Harry Reid, the majority leader, set in motion a series of votes on Obama administration nominees that could force a long-festering fight with Republicans to a head.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Democrats Poised to Limit Filibusters, Angering G.O.P.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tense Standoff In the Senate Over Altering Filibuster Rules', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peters, Jeremy W', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Filibusters and Debate Curbs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reid, Harry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McConnell, Mitch', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-11T15:19:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeremy W. Peters', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeremy', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Peters', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of