e': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The To Do List (Movie)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-11T17:02:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c5f5e9a-2dba-538a-b412-ffa0bbba9227', 'word_count': 2063, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c5f5e9a-2dba-538a-b412-ffa0bbba9227'}, {'abstract': 'Revisiting a 1968 New York magazine article about Viva, a member of Andy Warhol’s crew.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/11/viva-la-viva-gaby-hoffmanns-mother-also-made-for-interesting-reading/', 'snippet': 'Revisiting a 1968 New York magazine article about Viva, a member of Andy Warhol’s crew.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Sunday’s magazine, Taffy Brodesser-Akner writes about the child star Gaby Hoffmann, she of the intense hot-dog scene in “Field of Dreams,” who grew up in Lower Manhattan as the daughter of, as Brodesser-Akner puts it, “New York artistic royalty.” Her father was the actor Anthony Herrera, who played a villain on “As the World Turns,” and her mother, Viva, was part of Andy Warhol’s crew.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/11/magazine/11-viva/11-viva-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 504, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/11/magazine/11-viva/11-viva-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 504, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/11/magazine/11-viva/11-viva-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/11/magazine/11-viva/11-viva-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/11/magazine/11-viva/11-viva-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Viva la Viva: Gaby Hoffmann’s Mother Also Made for Interesting Reading', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-11T17:05:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Samantha Henig', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Samantha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Henig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e64f9866-dd41-5627-ba4e-474b9a3ac6c3', 'word_count': 491, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e64f9866-dd41-5627-ba4e-474b9a3ac6c3'}, {'abstract': 'A federal judge ruled that jurors in the civil trial of Fabrice Tourre, the former Goldman Sachs trader, can hear about an e-mail that references the nickname “Fabulous Fab.”', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/07/11/jurors-to-hear-about-the-fabulous-fab/', 'snippet': 'A federal judge ruled that jurors in the civil trial of Fabrice Tourre, the former Goldman Sachs trader, can hear about an e-mail that references the nickname “Fabulous Fab.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s hard to live down a nickname. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jurors to Hear About ‘Fabulous Fab’', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_hea