Pharmacy Benefits Firm', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Venture Capital', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hansen, Christopher R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brazil', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-11T22:56:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vinod Sreeharsha', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vinod', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sreeharsha', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61c70177-fef6-56c2-8989-81945e291af7', 'word_count': 430, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61c70177-fef6-56c2-8989-81945e291af7'}, {'abstract': 'Walk up the Royal Mile, browse portraits of famous Scots and pop in for a pint during a weekend in Scotland’s capital.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/14/travel/36-hours-in-edinburgh.html', 'snippet': 'Walk up the Royal Mile, browse portraits of famous Scots and pop in for a pint during a weekend in Scotland’s capital.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tourists descend on Edinburgh every August for the Edinburgh International Festival, a citywide celebration of theater, music, opera and dance performances; the nearly 3,000 Festival Fringe shows; and the Royal Edinburgh Military Tattoo — military bands playing pipes and drums followed by fireworks. But the Scottish capital’s historic sites and winding walks offer a different charm at quieter times of the year, and its restaurants are the highlight of any visit. Haggis and fish and chips now share menu space with local, organic and sustainable fare, and there is a cafe, restaurant or bar on practically every block. That means you can happily eat and drink your way through the city if the weather is wet — which is not unlikely, so plan your outdoor activities around the daily forecast. Before your trip, check The List (list.co.uk) for restaurant reviews and a guide to exhibitions, shows and events.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-sf/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 494, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-sf/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 494}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-sf/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 843, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-sf/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1686, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-sf/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-sf/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/travel/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-sf/14EDINBURGH_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '36 Hours in Edinburg