ppet': 'The Highway Diner and Bar presents classic diner fare with a Cajun twist in a setting that’s hardly traditional.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hamptons regulars — particularly those under the age of, say, 10 — have gawked at it a hundred times through their car windows: the old military tank beside the Montauk Highway in East Hampton, its gun aimed at the nonstop summer traffic. Now there is reason to take note of the rather unremarkable building next to it: The Highway Diner and Bar, the latest restaurant to lease the space from the Veterans of Foreign Wars Post 550.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14SUBDINELI2/14SUBDINELI2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14SUBDINELI2/14SUBDINELI2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14SUBDINELI2/14SUBDINELI2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14SUBDINELI2/14SUBDINELI2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1923, 'width': 1923, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14SUBDINELI2/14SUBDINELI2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14SUBDINELI2/14SUBDINELI2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cr