sks casually. She corrects him in a tone that suggests he is a silly old dear. “Last time it was a Boy Scout.” ', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14ARTSNJ1_SPAN/14ARTSNJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14ARTSNJ1_SPAN/14ARTSNJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14ARTSNJ1_SPAN/14ARTSNJ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14ARTSNJ1_SPAN/14ARTSNJ1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1301, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14ARTSNJ1_SPAN/14ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14ARTSNJ1_SPAN/14ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/nyregion/14ARTSNJ1_SPAN/14ARTSNJ1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Naughty Wives, Circa 1925', 'kicker': 'Theater Review | New Jersey', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Naughty Wives, Circa 1925', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gates, Anita', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madison (NJ)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Shakespeare Theater of New Jersey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coward, Noel', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Melissa', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mackie, Allison', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jesneck, Julie', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Noyes, Ned', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bender, Jeffrey M', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-12T18:53:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anita Gates', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anita', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gates', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/5a0cba8f-e24a-5dd2-8f20-c0a44a18480e', 'word_count': 741, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5a0cba8f-e24a-5dd2-8f20-c0a44a18480e'}, {'abstract': 'An exhibition at the Los Angeles museum highlights recent architectural innovation in the region over the last 25 years. In this revealing video, some of the featured architects explain why they chose their trade.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/12/on-view-architects-on-southern-california-architecture-at-moca/', 'snippet': 'An exhibition at the Los Angeles museum highlights recent architectural innovation in the region over the last 25 years. In this revealing video, some of the featured architects explain why they chose their trade.', 'lead_paragraph': '“A New Sculpturalism,” the current exhibition at the Geffen Contemporary at the Museum of Contemporary Art, Los Angeles, is a sweeping survey of the last quarter century of architectural innovation in Southern California. The show includes noteworthies like Frank Gehry, Thom Mayne and Greg Lynn and ranges from a set of industrial artists’ lofts in Santa Monica to the Cahill Center for Astronomy and Astrophysics in Pasadena. To celebrate, MOCA interviewed 36 of the featured architects about their practices. One of the most telling responses was to the question “Why did you become an architect?” The video above compiles some of the best answers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Architects on Southern California Architecture, at MOCA', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Denari, Neil', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lynn, Greg', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mayne, Thom', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Museum of Contemporary Art', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-12T19:02:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/721b4a49-8160-59fa-a46b-d63c16736f47', 'word_count': 104, 'uri': 'nyt://article/721b4a49-8160-59fa-a46b-d63c16736f47'}, {'abstract': 'British cyclist Mark Cavendish, who had lost two straight sprint finishes in the Tour de France, took the sprint in resounding fashion on Friday, beating one of his biggest rivals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/13/sports/cycling/13iht-tour13.html', 'snippet': 'British cyc