m at the annual Allen & Company media and technology conference in Idaho, Google executives used a news conference to promote their business.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/07/12/google-executives-discuss-youtube-the-phone-business-and-taxes/', 'snippet': 'Unlike the usual practice of staying mum at the annual Allen & Company media and technology conference in Idaho, Google executives used a news conference to promote their business.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SUN VALLEY, Idaho — It is a gathering where many executives make it a point to stay largely mum. But Google’s representatives at the Allen & Company media and technology conference here used their time to promote their business. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Google Executives Discuss YouTube, the Phone Business and Taxes', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Android (Operating System)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sun', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cook, Timothy D', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmidt, Eric E', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Samsung Group', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sun Valley (Idaho)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-12T19:46:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Bu