eported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f30efb65-5211-5705-97aa-6d3869ee8b22', 'word_count': 769, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f30efb65-5211-5705-97aa-6d3869ee8b22'}, {'abstract': 'The Employment Non-Discrimination Act, in its current form, would leave too many jobs outside the measure’s protection.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/12/an-unholy-religious-exemption/', 'snippet': 'The Employment Non-Discrimination Act, in its current form, would leave too many jobs outside the measure’s protection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gay rights advocates have been trying to get Congress to move legislation extending workplace protection to gay, lesbian bisexual and transgender people for nearly two decades. Finally, on Wednesday, a Senate Committee approved legislation that would do just that — the Employment Non-Discrimination Act.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Unholy Religious Exemption', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-12T20:10:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dorothy J. Samuels', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dorothy', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Samuels', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b742da5-6ce6-52f6-8cd3-75e5dff1ca36', 'word_count': 278, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b742da5-6ce6-52f6-8cd3-75e5dff1ca36'}, {'abstract': 'A father and husband who died when the children were young missed so much and is still missed so much, especially on cleaning-things-out day.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/14/booming/a-widow-airs-memories-from-the-dust-of-the-past.html', 'snippet': 'A father and husband who died when the children were young missed so much and is still missed so much, especially on cleaning-things-out day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a totally uncharacteristic move, I have been cleaning the house and attacking my closets with a rare enthusiasm and a sense of abandon I never believed possible. Some things are easy to pitch (what took so long?).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/booming/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/22/booming/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 448}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/booming/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/booming/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1530, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/booming/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/22/booming/22mystory-booming-cleaning-composite/22mystory-booming