e officer displayed a mix of defiance and tears on Friday as he begged a judge not to send him to jail for falsely saying he witnessed a drug sale and for arresting an innocent man.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Officer Sentenced for Lying About a Drug Sale', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sentencing For Ex-Officer Caught in Lie On Drug Sale', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alicea, Isaias', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'False Arrests, Convictions and Imprisonments', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-12T20:16:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Russ Buettner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Russ', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buettner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/79db4c15-8a14-5988-9947-f750fa9ee426', 'word_count': 404, 'uri': 'nyt://article/79db4c15-8a14-5988-9947-f750fa9ee426'}, {'abstract': 'Here are two Italian methods to serve peaches to their best advantage as a dessert.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/17/dining/desserts-that-strive-for-peach-perfect.html', 'snippet': 'Here are two Italian methods to serve peaches to their best advantage as a dessert.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With hot, sultry weather comes luscious, sweet, juicy stone fruit: just what we’ve been waiting for. Peaches, nectarines, cherries, apricots and plums fall into this category, and they are the true delights of summer. They all taste good together, whether baked in a cobbler or sliced for a fruit salad. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/dining/17KITCH1_SPAN/17KITCH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/17/dining/17KITCH1_SPAN/17KITCH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/dining/17KITCH1_SPAN/17KITCH1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/dining/17KITCH1_SPAN/17KITCH1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/dining/17KITCH1_SPAN/17KITCH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/17/dining/17KITCH1_SPAN/17KITCH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/dining/17KITCH1_SPAN/17KITCH1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Peach, Defuzzed and Besotted ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Peach, Defuzzed and Besotted', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', '