lay-that-game-too.html', 'snippet': 'College men want to have casual sex, and women want romance, right? Increasingly, however, women are the ones looking to hook up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At 11 on a weeknight earlier this year, her work finished, a slim, pretty junior at the University of Pennsylvania did what she often does when she has a little free time. She texted her regular hookup — the guy she is sleeping with but not dating. What was he up to? He texted back: Come over. So she did. They watched a little TV, had sex and went to sleep.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/fashion/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/fashion/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 592}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/fashion/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1011, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/fashion/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2022, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/fashion/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/14/fashion/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN/14COVCAMPUS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 