Youth Orchestra of the United States of America gave its debut performance on Thursday, then headed out on the road, giving talented teenagers a taste of the touring life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/13/arts/music/national-youth-orchestra-takes-purchase-washington-is-next.html', 'snippet': 'The National Youth Orchestra of the United States of America gave its debut performance on Thursday, then headed out on the road, giving talented teenagers a taste of the touring life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PURCHASE, N.Y. — The traditional way for young music students to learn the craft is to work steadily over multiple years with a trusted teacher. Playing regularly in ensembles and orchestras under expert coaches and conductors is also important.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13PURCHASE1/13PURCHASE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13PURCHASE1/13PURCHASE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13PURCHASE1/13PURCHASE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 646, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13PURCHASE1/13PURCHASE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1291, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13PURCHASE1/13PURCHASE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/13/art