.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama has little to show for the first six months of his second term beyond gridlock in Congress, turmoil in the Middle East and assorted administration controversies.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'History Says Obama, in Second Term, Has Time Yet to Make Impact', 'kicker': 'Political Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'History Says Obama, in Second Term, Has Time Yet to Make Impact', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harwood, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidents and Presidency (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-12T21:11:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Harwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/067c65f7-b20c-5bab-90b0-ddcb081a2ee3', 'word_count': 881, 'uri': 'nyt://article/067c65f7-b20c-5bab-90b0-ddcb081a2ee3'}, {'abstract': 'The four-woman post-punk Savages played Webster Hall on Thursday night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/13/arts/music/savages-brings-its-intellectual-punk-to-webster-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The four-woman post-punk Savages played Webster Hall on Thursday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s now a standard practice of pop, if not a law, to loop back one or two or three generations and use indirect memory to find new sparks. But some new bands, in some circumstances, might have actually sounded better 30 years ago. Savages, the British quar