 in Bali, Indonesia, over the last two weeks of September.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The women’s and senior trials started in Orlando on Friday. Two teams will be selected in each event to represent the United States at the world team championships in Bali, Indonesia, over the last two weeks of September. Details are at usbf.org and play can be watched at bridgebase.com.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13card-1/13card-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 355, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13card-1/13card-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 355, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13card-1/13card-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13card-1/13card-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/13/arts/13card-1/13card-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Women’s and Senior Trials Begin in Orlando', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Women’s and Senior Trials Begin in Orlando', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cards and Card Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridge (Card Game)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-12T21:37:48+0000', 'document_type': 'arti