 — If you ever have a chance to come to the American Crossword Puzzle Tournament (and I hope you do), walk up to Byron Walden and shake his hand. Tell him I said “hi.” He’ll be happy to meet you, really he will. He’s an affable chap, with a big smile, and one of the nicest puzzlers I know.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'W’s is 74', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-13T02:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9b8876e-8503-59fe-a498-132c74ae5e06', 'word_count': 306, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9b8876e-8503-59fe-a498-132c74ae5e06'}, {'abstract': 'According to the data verified by the Gerontology Research Group, Susannah Mushatt Jones is the oldest resident in the state and the second-oldest American.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/13/nyregion/oldest-woman-in-new-york-celebrates-birthday-no-114.html', 'snippet': 'According to the data verified by the Gerontology Research Group, Susannah Mushatt Jones is the oldest resident in the state and the second-oldest American.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Susannah Mushatt Jones knew it was a special day.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/13/nyregion/13party/13party-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/13/nyregion/13party/1