ts/golf/here-lie-2-grand-slam-golf-dreams.html', 'snippet': 'The mystique of golf’s most elusive quest, the modern professional Grand Slam, only increased after two of the sport’s greatest players had their best chances die at Muirfield.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Muirfield doesn’t resemble a cemetery. Anything but. Its velvet green fairways and scraggly brownish rough in the Scottish linksland near Edinburgh have no tombs or gravestones, but it’s where two Grand Slam opportunities are buried.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/DOG-ANDERSON-2/DOG-ANDERSON-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 763, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/DOG-ANDERSON-2/DOG-ANDERSON-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 763}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/DOG-ANDERSON-2/DOG-ANDERSON-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 805, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/DOG-ANDERSON-2/DOG-ANDERSON-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1610, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/DOG-ANDERSON-2/DOG-ANDERSON-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/DOG-ANDERSON-2/DOG-ANDERSON-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/DOG-ANDERSON-2/DOG-ANDERSON-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Here Lie 2 Grand Slam Golf Dreams', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Here Lie 2 Grand Slam Dreams', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'British Open (Golf)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nicklaus, Jack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-13T17:26:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Anderson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Anderson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/da1ca32f-0310-55d7-abbb-9108dc6f7555', 'word_count': 852, 'uri': 'nyt://article/da1ca32f-0310-55d7-abbb-9108dc6f7555'}, {'abstract': 'An economist questions whether it’s wise for government to encourage homeownership over renting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/14/business/owning-a-home-isnt-always-a-virtue.html', 'snippet': 'An economist questions whether it’s wise for government to encourage homeownership over renting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ENCOURAGING homeownership has been considered a national goal at least since “Own Your Own Home Day” was introduced in 1920 by various business and civic groups as part of a National Thrift Week. The newly popular word “homeownership” represented a goal and a virtue for every good citizen — to get out of the tenements and into one’s own home. Homeownership was thought to encourage planning, discipline, permanency and community spirit.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-VIEW/14-VIEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 446, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-VIEW/14-VIEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 446}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-VIEW/14-VIEW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-VIEW/14-VIEW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1524, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-VIEW/14-VIEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-VIEW/14-VIEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-VIEW/14-VIEW-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Owning a Home Isn’t Always a Virtue', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Owning A Home Isn’t Always A Virtue', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shiller, Robert J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Renting and Leasing (Real Estate)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subjec