 strengths but not ignore your weaknesses, and you have to be brave to do both.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'I GREW up in Fayetteville, Tenn. I remember it as a small town with a lovely town square. My grandmother lived close by, in a white Victorian house that had been in my family for generations. It had a wraparound porch and a yard with a tire swing and oak trees. I spent many summer nights chasing fireflies in that yard.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-BOSS/14-BOSS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-BOSS/14-BOSS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 778}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-BOSS/14-BOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 791, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-BOSS/14-BOSS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1226, 'width': 946, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-BOSS/14-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-BOSS/14-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-BOSS/14-BOSS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Build-A-Bear’s C.E.O., on the Courage to Branch Out', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Courage to Branch Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executives and Management (Theory)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Careers and Professions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Build-A-Bear Workshop Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'John, Sharon Price', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-13T17:58:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sharon John', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sharon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'John', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d92bcd31-e53c-5c87-a554-0c5986880ae3', 'word_count': 652, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d92bcd31-e53c-5c87-a554-0c5986880ae3'}, {'abstract': 'Planned and executed wisely, the humble to-do list can be a goad to productivity. But don’t let wishful thinking govern its length.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/14/jobs/how-to-conquer-your-to-do-list.html', 'snippet': 'Planned and executed wisely, the humble to-do list can be a goad to productivity. But don’t let wishful thinking govern its length.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MAKING a to-do list should be easy: You just write down all the things you need to do, do them, and check them off your list as you go along, right? ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/business/14-WORK/14-WORK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 567, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'c