what drives them, tell us how they pine, reveal how they tick.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/13/tell-their-secrets/', 'snippet': 'To shape characters, show us what drives them, tell us how they pine, reveal how they tick.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I learned early on that reading novels could save me. Even before I heard Simon and Garfunkel sing it in “I Am a Rock,” I knew that I had my books and my poetry to protect me. But it was not so much the books themselves that I loved as the characters I found within their covers.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tell Their Secrets', 'kicker': 'Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tell Their Secrets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-13T18:35:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Silas House', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Silas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'House', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99f4e240-b469-5d61-9f87-6ab9a52066b5', 'word_count': 1251, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99f4e240-b469-5d61-9f87-6ab9a52066b5'}, {'abstract': 'The Scottish actor David Tennant on swotting up on the Beatles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/14/opinion/sunday/david-tennant.html', 'snippet': 'The Scottish actor David Tennant on swotting up on the Beatles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Tennant is a Scottish actor whose work ranges from his critically acclaimed performances as part of the Royal Shakespeare Company to roles in various popular BBC television programs including “Dr. Who” and “Broadchurch,” which premieres in