ing-quarterback.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Sanchez’s annual California summer camp for his teammates has proceeded as in years past, though without the rookie Geno Smith, wh0 may displace him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MISSION VIEJO, Calif. — Attendees at Mark Sanchez’s fourth annual Jets West passing camp each returned home with an iPad mini, an adult-size onesie and a Nike backpack. They also received three sets of headphones, some funky dress socks and a fancy camera. A water bottle, a mug, loads of T-shirts and shorts, and don’t forget the Frisbee. Even a bottle of hand sanitizer that, in this age of Twitter, was splashed with a JetsWest hashtag.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/CITY-JETS/CITY-JETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/CITY-JETS/CITY-JETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/CITY-JETS/CITY-JETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/CITY-JETS/CITY-JETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/CITY-JETS/CITY-JETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/14/sports/CITY-JETS/CITY-JETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumb