nippet': 'Despite Ike Davis’s continuing struggles, the Mets beat the Pirates. Still, they remain in fourth place, and many questions will greet them when they resume play Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PITTSBURGH — Ike Davis was the Mets’ second-to-last batter Sunday afternoon in their last game before the All-Star break. Davis, a pinch-hitter, grounded into a double play, leaving a fresh image for the team to consider during its brief midsummer vacation.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15mets/15mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15mets/15mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15mets/15mets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15mets/15mets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15mets/15mets-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15mets/15mets-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15mets/15mets-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType'