ed to a girlfriend that he sold toxic real estate bonds to “widows and orphans.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Goldman and Before Trial, a Global Education for Fabrice Tourre', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Trader, A Global Education Before a Trial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tourre, Fabrice P', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-14T21:17:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susanne Craig and Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Craig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/640e1edb-b284-54f4-8e5c-199b2cba231c', 'word_count': 1350, 'uri': 'nyt://article/640e1edb-b284-54f4-8e5c-199b2cba231c'}, {'abstract': 'The Yankees committed two errors, were charged with a passed ball, allowed five unearned runs and lost a series to the Twins for the first time since 2008.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/sloppy-play-does-in-yankees-ahead-of-all-star-break.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees committed two errors, were charged with a passed ball, allowed five unearned runs and lost a series to the Twins for the first time since 2008.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Through the first 94 games of the season, the Yankees earned a reputation as gritty overachievers, defying expectations of a potential collapse with a cast of unknowns. Despite a lineup that was decimated by injuries and routinely overmatched, the Yankees used strong pitching and solid defense to stay above .500 and remain in striking distance of a playoff spot.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15yankees/15yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15yankees/15yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15yankees/15yankees-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15yankees/15yankees-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1515, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15yankees/15yankees-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15yankees/15yankees-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/sports/baseball/15yankees/15yankees-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thum