reliminary ratings show that from 10 to 11 p.m. on Saturday, Fox News and CNN each attracted more than three million viewers, and MSNBC had about 1.3 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite breaking late on a weekend evening, the verdict in the murder trial of George Zimmerman attracted an audience of more than 10 million viewers to cable news networks, a huge total for a Saturday night.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Zimmerman Verdict Drew 10 Million to Cable TV News', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Zimmerman Verdict Drew 10 Million to Cable TV News', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings (Audience Measurement)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox News Channel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CNN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MSNBC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HLN', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-15T16:22:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a89cea9f-efbf-5604-b51c-f83ace8a3cf0', 'word_count': 374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a89cea9f-efbf-5604-b51c-f83ace8a3cf0'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. McCarthy, the former Playboy Playmate and actress, will fill one of the empty chairs left by the departures of Joy Behar and Elisabeth Hasselbeck.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/16/business/media/jenny-mccarthy-to-join-the-view-on-abc.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. McCarthy, the former Playboy Playmate and actress, will fill one of the empty chairs left by the departures of Joy Behar and Elisabeth Hasselbeck.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the vacancies on ABC’s longtime hit daytime television talk show “The View” has been filled by Jenny McCarthy, the former Playboy Playmate and actress.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/business/16view/16view-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 842, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/16/business/16view/16view-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 842}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/business/16view/16view-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 731, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/business/16view/16view-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1461, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/business/16view/16view-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/16/business/16view/16view-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/business/16view/16view-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jenny McCarthy to Join ‘The View’ on ABC', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Actress to Fill One Vacancy In the Cast Of ‘The View’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCarthy, Jenny', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walters, Barbara', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Behar, Joy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hasselbeck, Elisabeth', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The View (TV Program)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-15T16:22:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e7b028d6-7e21-51e1-adaa-088666e77044', 'word_count': 493, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7b028d6-7e21-51e1-adaa-088666e77044'}, {'abstract': 'Black-Irish relations in 19th century New York were more complex than many realize.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/15/new-yorks-mixed-race-riot/', 'snippet': 'Black-Irish relations in 19th century New York were more complex than many realize.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When draft rioters set fire to the Colored Orphan Asylum in New York on the night of July 13, 1863, one man in the crowd called out, “If there is a man among you with a heart within him, come and help these poor children!” Incensed, the crowd turned on him and almost dismembered him. But he had distracted them, enabling the orphans to escape.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York’s Mixed-Race Riot', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo