alkabout-signs-of-an-egyptian-comeback-more-training-for-pilots/', 'snippet': 'A weekly capsule of travel news curated by our writers and editors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Egyptian Comeback? There are signs of a revival for Egypt’s tourism industry, though huge challenges remain as the country continues to struggle with a stable government. (Reuters, via Skift)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Walkabout: Signs of an Egyptian Comeback; More Training for Pilots', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-15T17:06:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ec6adbe-dfe4-5f42-a39b-d4ef8dea8b76', 'word_count': 146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ec6adbe-dfe4-5f42-a39b-d4ef8dea8b76'}, {'abstract': 'The civil trial of former Goldman Sachs trader Fabrice P. Tourre over a failed investment product began Monday in Federal District Court in Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/07/15/trial-of-former-goldman-trader-gets-under-way/', 'snippet': 'The civil trial of former Goldman Sachs trader Fabrice P. Tourre over a failed investment product began Monday in Federal District Court in Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': '9:16 p.m. | Updated ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jury Is Seated at Trader’s Trial, Then Is Showered With Jargon', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jury Is Seated at Trader’s Trial, Then Is Showered With Jargon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collateralized Debt Obligations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Forrest, Katherine B', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tourre, Fabrice P', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-15T17:20:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced and Susanne Craig', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Craig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f58ab481-7fd7-501e-9be8-feb4942af962', 'word_count': 884, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f58ab481-7fd7-501e-9be8-feb4942af962'}, {'abstract': 'Carolina dogs, like a few other breeds, are without certain genetic markers indicating European origins, suggesting they have been in the Americas since the last Ice Age.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/16/science/a-dog-that-goes-way-back.html', 'snippet': 'Carolina dogs, like a few other breeds, are without certain genetic markers indicating European origins, suggesting they have been in the Americas since the last Ice Age.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BISHOPVILLE, S.C. — Inside a fenced acre on the swampy Lynches River flood plain in central South Carolina, seven of Don Anderson’s primitive dogs spring into high alert at approaching strangers. Medium-sized, they fan out amid his junkyard of improvised habitat: a few large barrels