': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/d641e9c0-7d59-536a-8757-200052b985fb'}, {'abstract': 'Cory Monteith, who played the high-school football star turned glee-squad member on that hit Fox musical comedy, was found dead in his room at the Fairmont Pacific Rim hotel on Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/15/more-tests-needed-to-determine-cause-of-death-for-cory-monteith/', 'snippet': 'Cory Monteith, who played the high-school football star turned glee-squad member on that hit Fox musical comedy, was found dead in his room at the Fairmont Pacific Rim hotel on Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Further testing will be required to determine a cause of death for Cory Monteith, the actor and “Glee” star who died in Vancouver, British Columbia, over the weekend, the local authorities said on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/arts/monteith/monteith-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 356, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/15/arts/monteith/monteith-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 356}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/arts/monteith/monteith-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 570, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/arts/monteith/monteith-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 570, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/arts/monteith/monteith-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/15/arts/monteith/