bout 2,000 opponents of a Senate immigration bill that would create a path to citizenship held a “March for Jobs” in Washington in a bid to draw blacks to the cause.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/15/anti-citizenship-protesters-issue-warning-to-house/', 'snippet': 'About 2,000 opponents of a Senate immigration bill that would create a path to citizenship held a “March for Jobs” in Washington in a bid to draw blacks to the cause.', 'lead_paragraph': 'About 2,000 demonstrators opposed to an immigration bill passed by the Senate marched down Pennsylvania Avenue in sweltering heat on Monday and rallied outside the Capitol, hoping to stop any similar measure — especially one that would grant legal status to illegal immigrants — from advancing in the House of Representatives.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Anti-Citizenship Protesters Issue Warning to House', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Workers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-15T22:22:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d319eb83-5c7a-5be3-8ed6-80d77f99f14e', 'word_count': 644, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d319eb83-5c7a-5be3-8ed6-80d77f99f14e'}, {'abstract': 'Recent developments in health and science news. This week: a lizard preserved 23 million years in amber and NASA mulls another mission to Mars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/16/science/a-cholesterol-breakthrough-and-sharp-sharks.html', 'snippet': 'Recent developments in health and science news. This week: a lizard preserved 23 million years in amber and NASA mulls another mission to Mars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s been a week for looking upward, inward, below the surface and back in time. NASA announced plans for a mission to bring a piece of Mars back to Earth, while on our planet there was news of a genetic breakthrough that could lead to almost absurdly low levels of “bad” cholesterol. Scientists reported on a shark that hunts with its tail, and on the fossil of a really, really old lizard — very small and, in its reptilian way, quite appealing.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/science/16WEE/16WEE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 537, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/16/science/16WEE/16WEE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 537}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/science/16WEE/16WEE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 916, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/science/16WEE/16WEE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1679, 'width': 1876, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/science/16WEE/16WEE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':