oomberg was mistaken when he indicated that New York City Football Club would play its home games at Yankee Stadium.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For a moment this weekend, it seemed that New York City Football Club had found a home. The Major League Soccer expansion team, which is partly owned by Manchester City of England’s Premier League and the Yankees, does not begin play until 2015, but Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg appeared to indicate in his weekly radio address that the club would play its home games at Yankee Stadium.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bloomberg Errs in Saying Yankee Stadium Will Be Soccer Team’s Base', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mayor Errs in Saying Yankee Stadium Will Be New Team’s Base', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Borden, Sam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yankee Stadium (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York City Football Club (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stadiums and Arenas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-16T05:22:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/898dd5b0-8cc5-5b8d-ad6e-73a774698156', 'word_count': 340, 'uri': 'nyt://article/898dd5b0-8cc5-5b8d-ad6e-73a774698156'}, {'abstract': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blo