Bootleg Series, Vol. 10 – Another Self Portrait (1969-1971),” will be released on Aug. 27, and will contain outtakes from the sessions for “Self Portrait” and its follow-up, “New Morning.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/16/latest-in-bob-dylans-bootleg-series-another-self-portrait-coming-in-august/', 'snippet': '“The Bootleg Series, Vol. 10 – Another Self Portrait (1969-1971),” will be released on Aug. 27, and will contain outtakes from the sessions for “Self Portrait” and its follow-up, “New Morning.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whenever Bob Dylan picks up a paintbrush he usually stirs up trouble. It happened in 2011, when a gallery exhibition of his paintings looked more like famous photographs of Asia than scenes he might have observed on his travels there. And, perhaps most notoriously, it happened in 1970 when Mr. Dylan put a painting of himself on the cover of an album called “Self Portrait” — an album that provoked a Rolling Stone review by Greil Marcus so negative that its opening rhetorical query cannot be reproduced in a family newspaper. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/arts/dylan/dylan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 609, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/16/arts/dylan/dylan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 609}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/arts/dylan/dylan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1010, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/arts/dylan/dylan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1522, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/arts/dylan/dylan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/16/arts/dylan/dylan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/16/arts/dylan/dylan-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Latest in Bob Dylan’s Bootleg Series, ‘Another Self Portrait,’ Coming in August', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dylan, Bob', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Columbia Records', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-16T13:55:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f37eb44-2cb8-5e2c-92bb-45cf7beaf238', 'word_count': 256, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f37eb44-2cb8-5e2c-92bb-45cf7beaf238'}, {'abstract': 'Datsun returns – in India – and Red Bull holds Soap Box Derbies in England and Germany.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/16/wheelies-the-land-of-the-rising-datsun-edition/', 'snippet': 'Datsun returns – in India – and Red Bull holds Soap Box Derbies in England and Germany.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In which we bring you motoring news from around the Web:', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xl