lication that seemed aimed at insulating President Vladimir V. Putin from United States pressure and blame.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/17/world/europe/snowden-submits-application-for-asylum-in-russia.html', 'snippet': 'Edward J. Snowden submitted an application that seemed aimed at insulating President Vladimir V. Putin from United States pressure and blame.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Edward J. Snowden, the former intelligence contractor on the run from the American authorities, on Tuesday formally requested temporary asylum in Russia, submitting an application that seemed aimed at insulating President Vladimir V. Putin from United States pressure and blame.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leaker Files for Asylum to Remain in Russia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leaker Files For Asylum To Remain In Russia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Asylum, Right of', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-16T15:46:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By David M. Herszenhorn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3243636c-efbf-57bf-aafe-29ee548fc5ca', 'word_count': 654, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3243636c-efbf-57bf-aafe-29ee548fc5ca'}, {'abstract': 'Shia LaBeouf and the producers of “Orphans” reached a settlement in response to a grievance Mr. LaBeouf filed with the Actors’ Equity union.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/16/labeouf-and-orphans-producers-settle-over-firing/', 'snippet': 'Shia LaBeouf and the producers of “Orphans” reached a settlement in response to a grievance Mr. LaBeouf filed with the Actors’ Equity union.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The actor Shia LaBeouf has reached a settlement with the producers of the Broadway play “Orphans” over his firing from the show in February, which came after Mr. LaBeouf clashed during rehearsals with the director, Daniel Sullivan, and its star, Alec Baldwin. The producers, Robert Cole and Frederick Zollo, and Mr. LaBeouf announced the settlement in a statement on Tuesday; the terms were not released, though the producers did offer words of praise for Mr. LaBeouf.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15LaBeouf/15moth-LaBeouf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 820, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15LaBeouf/15moth-LaBeouf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 820}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15LaBeouf/15moth-LaBeouf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1005, 'width': 735, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15LaBeouf/15moth-LaBeouf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1005, 'width': 735, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15LaBeouf/15moth-LaBeouf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'c