one, 'lastname': 'Schmidt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Web Log', '_id': 'nyt://article/4602f2a5-977e-5ae4-b849-f24ca0133e26', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4602f2a5-977e-5ae4-b849-f24ca0133e26'}, {'abstract': 'Profit of $1.9 billion in the second quarter sounds like a return to the good old days at Goldman Sachs. But the firm hasn’t managed to solidly outpace rivals.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/07/16/goldmans-not-the-leader-of-the-wall-street-pack/', 'snippet': 'Profit of $1.9 billion in the second quarter sounds like a return to the good old days at Goldman Sachs. But the firm hasn’t managed to solidly outpace rivals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Goldman Sachs isn’t yet the envy of Wall Street again. The investment bank generated $1.9 billion of profit in the second quarter, twice the figure of a year ago and beating the estimates of analysts by a third. Though it sounds like a return to Goldman’s good old days, it hasn’t managed to solidly outpace rivals.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Goldman’s Not the Leader of the Wall Street Pack', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwartz, Harvey M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-16T18:57:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Antony Currie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Antony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Currie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e21d8996-b37f-5d60-bd2e-8153eb5d345f', 'word_count': 373, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e21d8996-b37f-5d60-bd2e-8153eb5d345f'}, {'abstract': 'Shakespeare’s Globe plans to tour “Hamlet” to every country on earth starting in 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/16/a-worldwide-tour-for-hamlet/', 'snippet': 'Shakespeare’s Globe plans to tour “Hamlet” to every country on earth starting in 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“All the world’s a stage,” wrote Shakespeare. Now Shakespeare’s Globe is putting those words into action. The London theater company announced on Tuesday an ambitious plan to perform “Hamlet” in every nation on earth. A cast of eight is expected to tour with a modest production of the tragedy for two years, starting April 23, 2014, the 450th anniversary of what is believed to be Shakespeare’s birth, and ending on April 23, 2016, the 400th anniversary of his death.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15globe/15globe-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15globe/15globe-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15globe/15globe-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15globe/15globe-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1421, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15globe/15globe-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15globe/15globe-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/15/theater/15globe/15globe-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Worldwide Tour for ‘Hamlet’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Hamlet,’ Globalized', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Hamlet (Play)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shakespeare, William', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Shakespeare's Globe Theater", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-16T19:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1bc5dc55-656a-5aa1-9339-31548393f5b2', 'word_count': 207, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1bc5dc55-656a-5aa1-9339-31548393f5b2'}, {'abstract': 'The Zagg iPad Mini Folio, a keyboard cover, makes an iPad Mini seem more like a laptop.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/18/technology/personaltech/a-tablet-keyboard-with-a-few-new-angles.html', 'snippet': 'The Zagg iPad Mini Folio, a keyboard cover, makes an iPad Mini seem more like a laptop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Connecting a keyboard to a tablet goes a long way toward making the tablet more like a laptop. But one keyboard, the Zagg iPad Mini Folio, takes it a step further with o