le-and-prudencia-hart-sing-anew-in-london.html', 'snippet': 'In London, John Doyle has made an honest musical out of “The Color Purple,” and an academic makes a deal with the Devil in “The Strange Undoing of Prudencia Hart.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — In one of this summer’s most surprising marriages, John Doyle has made an honest musical out of “The Color Purple.” This minimalist director’s take on the stage adaptation of Alice Walker’s novel, which opened on Monday night at the Menier Chocolate Factory here, is so lithe and muscular that at first it’s hard to detect even remnants of the big, bloated show that “The Color Purple” once was.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/arts/17purple/17purple-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 586, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/17/arts/17purple/17purple-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 586}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/arts/17purple/17purple-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/arts/17purple/17purple-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1471, 'width': 1507, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/arts/17purple/17purple-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/17/arts/17purple/17purple-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None,