 can also call her something else: his lawfully wedded wife. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The President of Venezuela Weds His ‘First Combatant’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The President of Venezuela Weds His ‘First Combatant’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maduro, Nicolas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-17T00:13:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Neuman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neuman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/15004b84-61ab-5703-a2c2-472069d31c9a', 'word_count': 359, 'uri': 'nyt://article/15004b84-61ab-5703-a2c2-472069d31c9a'}, {'abstract': 'The Mets’ young ace, who started for the National League, was at the front of a procession of All-Star players in Midtown Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/17/sports/baseball/matt-harvey-leads-a-parade-of-all-stars.html', 'snippet': 'The Mets’ young ace, who started for the National League, was at the front of a procession of All-Star players in Midtown Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first sign that things might finally be looking up for the Mets appeared at the very start of the parade of major leaguers in Midtown Manhattan on Tuesday afternoon before the All-Star Game at Citi Field.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Parade of Stars With a Met in Front', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Parade of Stars With a Met in Front', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALL STAR GAMES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parades', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citi Field (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harvey, Matt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-17T00:21:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/49699fcd-c670-5229-82bb-f8caa68a3d28', 'word_count': 368, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49699fcd-c670-5229-82bb-f8caa68a3d28'}, {'abstract': 'At the government’s behest, the supplement manufacturer USPlabs destroyed $8 million worth of Jack3d and OxyElite Pro, workout boosters that contained a stimulant believed to be harmful.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/17/business/supplements-called-risky-are-destroyed.html', 'snippet': 'At the government’s behest, the supplement manufacturer USPlabs destroyed $8 million worth of Jack3d and OxyElite Pro, workout boosters that contained a stimulant believed to be harmful.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Under pressure from federal health regulators, the manufacturer of two popular sports supplements has voluntarily destroyed the inventory of the products, the Food and Drug Administration said on Tuesday.', 'print_section