n. And the designer Alber Elbaz of Lanvin gave one of the best-attended parties of the week, at Le Trianon concert hall, to celebrate his limited-edition cosmetics collaboration with Lancôme. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18SKIN_SPAN/18zSKIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18SKIN_SPAN/18zSKIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18SKIN_SPAN/18zSKIN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18SKIN_SPAN/18zSKIN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1375, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18SKIN_SPAN/18zSKIN1-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18SKIN_SPAN/18zSKIN1-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18SKIN_SPAN/18zSKIN1-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fashion Designers Driving Innovation in Makeup', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Fingers in the Makeup Pot', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shapiro, Bee', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-17T03:18:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bee Shapiro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bee', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shapiro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9331f3d4-c896-5f13-943f-2c0649047875', 'word_count': 1005, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9331f3d4-c896-5f13-943f-2c0649047875'}, {'abstract': 'Surgeon General Regina Benjamin left her job on Tuesday and said she would return to work at the clinic she founded in Bayou La Batre, Ala.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/17/us/last-day-for-surgeon-general.html', 'snippet': 'Surgeon General Regina Benjamin left her job on Tuesday and said she would return to work at the clinic she founded in Bayou La Batre, Ala.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Surgeon General Regina Benjamin left her job on Tuesday and said she would return to work at the clinic she founded in Bayou La Batre, Ala. Dr. Benjamin, 56, gave no reason for her departure when she announced it last month, fueling speculation that she might run for Congress. Her departure leaves the administration without one of its most visible public liaisons as it prepares Americans for crucial provisions of the health care law that are set to take effect next year. Dr. Benjamin was widely praised for her efforts to prevent diseases and promote physical fitness. She has been mentioned as a possible Democratic candidate in a special election in Alabama’s First Congressional District, where Representative Jo Bonner, a Republican, is stepping down next month. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Last Day for Surgeon General', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Washington', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Last Day For Surgeon General', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Benjamin, Regina M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attorneys General', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-17T03:21:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Southall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Southall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/a3550508-8b5c-5262-9fdc-ba706e374ec8', 'word_count': 126, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a3550508-8b5c-5262-9fdc-ba706e374ec8'}, {'abstract': 'The Obama administration has hired Equifax Workforce Solutions to help verify information provided on subsidy applications under the new health care law.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/17/us/politics/credit-reporting-agency-hired-to-verify-incomes-for-insurance-subsidies.html', 'snippet': 'The Obama administration has hired Equifax Workforce Solutions to help verify information provided on subsidy applications under the new health care law.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Obama administration has hired a credit reporting agency to help verify the incomes of people who apply for federal subsidies to buy insurance under the new health care law. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/17/us/HE