: 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e3cad40-e71f-5ccc-8f2b-a84e2f98498e', 'word_count': 1817, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e3cad40-e71f-5ccc-8f2b-a84e2f98498e'}, {'abstract': 'A fresh look at sales operations yielded some important benefits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/18/business/smallbusiness/with-sales-collapsing-an-owner-turns-to-a-consultant.html', 'snippet': 'A fresh look at sales operations yielded some important benefits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year, my custom conference table business suffered a collapse in sales that caused me a great deal of anguish and led me to try a number of solutions. Most important, I hired a sales consultant to provide a critical evaluation of our selling methods, to suggest changes and to work with us to carry out those recommendations. This was expensive, costing almost $38,000, but the knowledge we gained from a fresh look at our sales operation provided a number of important benefits.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/business/18sbiz/18sbiz-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/18/business/18sbiz/18sbiz-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/business/18sbiz/18sbiz-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/business/18sbiz/18sbiz-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1383, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {