ain find that older people are getting healthier and experiencing less dementia.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/17/in-europe-dementia-rates-may-be-falling/', 'snippet': 'New studies from Denmark and Britain find that older people are getting healthier and experiencing less dementia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We talk about some grim stuff in this space, so when a bit of good news surfaces about aging, we want to celebrate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Europe, Dementia Rates May Be Falling', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dementia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Longevity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-17T17:42:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paula Span', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paula', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Span', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ced1721e-c623-50b9-8745-df077ae76e0f', 'word_count': 871, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ced1721e-c623-50b9-8745-df077ae76e0f'}, {'abstract': 'Brooks and Collins discuss the return of the maverick John McCain and the inner lives of politicians, such as they are.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/17/the-filibuster-lives/', 'snippet': 'Brooks and Collins discuss the return of the maverick John McCain and the inner lives of politicians, such as they are.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gail Collins: David, I just realized something — what with vacations and your upcoming book leave, this will be our last public conversation until January. I hate to think of all the fiscal cliffs I’ll have to negotiate wi