, 'word_count': 962, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8cf63149-8473-57aa-81af-b39a979f477d'}, {'abstract': 'Breaking its silence on a rusty freighter seized by Panama and found to be carrying weapons for Cuba, North Korea demanded the ship’s release.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/18/world/americas/north-korean-ship-cuba.html', 'snippet': 'Breaking its silence on a rusty freighter seized by Panama and found to be carrying weapons for Cuba, North Korea demanded the ship’s release.', 'lead_paragraph': 'North Korea broke four days of silence early Thursday over a rusty North Korean freighter impounded by Panama for concealing a load of Cuban weapons, insisting that they were transported legally and demanding that the Panamanian authorities immediately release the vessel and its 35 detained crew members.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/world/18panama_map/18panama_map-jumbo.png', 'height': 360, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/world/18panama_map/18panama_map-superJumbo.png', 'height': 360, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/world/18panama_map/18panama_map-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/18/world/18panama_map/18panama_map-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/world/18panama_map/18panama_map-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLa