ce-bar-has-landed-in-midtown-manhattan.html', 'snippet': 'At the Minus 5 Ice Bar, the temperature is 23 degrees, the bar is frozen and all the drinks are on ice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The ice bar, once consigned to the arctic reaches of Norway or Sweden, has landed in Midtown Manhattan. Or more precisely, in the lobby of the New York Hilton Midtown, where Minus 5 opened in early July and serves chilly cocktails that are all “in the rocks” — even the glasses are made of ice.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18BOITE_SPAN/18zBOITE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18BOITE_SPAN/18zBOITE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18BOITE_SPAN/18zBOITE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18BOITE_SPAN/18zBOITE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18BOITE_SPAN/18zBOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18BOITE_SPAN/18zBOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/fashion/18BOITE_SPAN/18zBOITE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Minus 5 Ice Bar has Landed in Midtown Manhattan', 'kicker': 'Boîte', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Minus 5 Ice Bar | Midtown Manhattan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Hilton', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Midtown Area (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minus 5 (Manhattan, NY, Bar)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-17T21:48:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Sloan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sloan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8df1a797-bf43-56d3-b60f-6492e19341de', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8df1a797-bf43-56d3-b60f-6492e19341de'}, {'abstract': 'New York City’s heat was so intense on Tuesday night that the Philharmonic shortened its final free outdoor concert in the Bronx.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/18/arts/music/dvorak-is-one-casualty-of-the-citys-heat-wave.html', 'snippet': 'New York City’s heat was so intense on Tuesday night that the Philharmonic shortened its final free outdoor concert in the Bronx.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How hot was it? So hot that the New York Philharmonic skipped half its program on Tuesday night, prompting scattered protests from disappointed concertgoers who chanted, “We want Dvorak.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dvorak Is One Casualty of the City’s Heat Wave', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dvorak Is One Casualty Of the City’s Heat Wave', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Philharmonic', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Van Cortlandt Park (Bronx, NY)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-17T21:56:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Barron', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barron', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb0475c8-7ca2-529b-9761-c447593e25a1', 'word_count': 679, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb0475c8-7ca2-529b-9761-c447593e25a1'}, {'abstract': 'The Bessie Awards on Wednesday announced 40 nominees in several categories and gave awards to Darrell Jones and Joanna Kotze.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/17/darrell-jones-and-joanna-kotze-win-bessie-awards-for-choreography/', 'snippet': 'The Bessie Awards on Wednesday announced 40 nominees in several categories and gave awards to Darrell Jones and Joanna Kotze.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The organizers of the Bessie Awards, as the annual New York Dance and Performance Awards are known, on Wednesday announced 40 nominees in several categories. Established in 1983, the awards recognize creative and groundbreaking work in choreography, performance, music composition and visual design, and are known as one of the highest honors in the dance world. An awards ceremony is scheduled for Oct. 7 at the Apo