e-british-open-mickelson-finds-mirth-in-wind-and-heather.html', 'snippet': 'After winning the Scottish Open last weekend, Phil Mickelson is at Muirfield seeking his first British Open title.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GULLANE, Scotland — On the golf course, Phil Mickelson wields a needle almost as deftly as he does a putter, with few topics out of bounds. He will rib his opponents about missed putts, made putts, their table tennis prowess, their fashion choices. It is banter as bonding exercise, a way of forging a connection by sharing laughs.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/sports/CITY-MICKELSON/CITY-MICKELSON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 310, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/18/sports/CITY-MICKELSON/CITY-MICKELSON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 310}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/sports/CITY-MICKELSON/CITY-MICKELSON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 529, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/sports/CITY-MICKELSON/CITY-MICKELSON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1059, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/sports/CITY-MICKELSON/CITY-MICKELSON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/18/sports/CITY-MICKELSON/CITY-MICKELSON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type'