ret, Mosi', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Identity Theft', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zieminski, Amanda', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Forteau, Clyde', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Cards', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-18T02:29:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mosi Secret', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mosi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Secret', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7bb3d02f-e224-503d-975b-c1dec07b2243', 'word_count': 546, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7bb3d02f-e224-503d-975b-c1dec07b2243'}, {'abstract': 'Darius McCollum, who has Asperger syndrome and a habit of taking buses and subways for joy rides, may have another chance at help, if he wants it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/18/nyregion/jailed-often-because-of-his-transit-obsession-man-may-get-help.html', 'snippet': 'Darius McCollum, who has Asperger syndrome and a habit of taking buses and subways for joy rides, may have another chance at help, if he wants it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over his three-decade career as New York City’s most notorious transit enthusiast, Darius McCollum has become an urban folk hero to some for his habit of posing as a friendly transit worker, driving buses that do not belong to him and taking city subways for joy rides. He has inspired a play. Someone is filming him for a new documentary. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/nyregion/bus/bus-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 