atic candidate for comptroller, on Wednesday released a portion of his federal tax return for the past two years. But the four pages that his campaign sent to reporters showed little beyond what his campaign had released the day before, when it said he had income of $8 million over the past two years and paid about $3.6 million in taxes over that time.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spitzer Releases Partial Tax Returns', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spitzer Releases\r\nPartial Tax Returns', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spitzer, Eliot L', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaplan, Thomas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stringer, Scott M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Comptrollers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-18T03:39:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/693f829b-5ac0-5c50-8198-a48b3eddbcf5', 'word_count': 236, 'uri': 'nyt://article/693f829b-5ac0-5c50-8198-a48b3eddbcf5'}, {'abstract': 'Waits are hours long for “Rain Room,” an installation at the Museum of Modern Art that has rain falling all around, but miraculously, not on you.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/18/arts/steamy-wait-before-a-walk-in-a-museums-rain.html', 'snippet': 'Waits are hours long for “Rain Room,” an installation at the Museum of Modern Art that has rain falling all around, but miraculously, not on you.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alexander Guo had been waiting in the baking sun since 6:45 a.m. — nearly five and a half hours. Finally, ahead of him, people in line took three or four steps forward.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/us/18rainroom1/18rainroom1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/18/us/18rainroom1/18rainroom1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/us/18rainroom1/18rainroom1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/us/18rainroom1/18rainroom1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/us/18rainroom1/18rainroom1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/18/us/18rainroom1/18rainroom1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/us/18rainroom1/18rainroom1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Steamy Wait Before a Walk in a Museum’s Rain', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Steamy Wait Before a Walk in a Museum’s Rain', 'name':