ontractor, is currently in diplomatic limbo at the Moscow airport and has applied for asylum in Russia.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Guardian Journalist to Write Book on Surveillance', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Guardian Columnist Given Book Contract', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Guardian (British Newspaper)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greenwald, Glenn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Holt, Henry, & Co', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-18T04:11:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60f42518-3ab3-589a-a2cc-d7323568a540', 'word_count': 207, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60f42518-3ab3-589a-a2cc-d7323568a540'}, {'abstract': 'The Fort Bragg Patriots are primarily made up of active-duty combat veterans who play to bond with one another and reconnect with the game they love.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/07/18/sports/hockey/Patriots-Ho