b200aa19-fac9-50bb-977d-93b0421b2df6', 'word_count': 477, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b200aa19-fac9-50bb-977d-93b0421b2df6'}, {'abstract': 'When disaster strikes, there are steps to take that can mean the difference between survival and ruin.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/18/the-worst-two-weeks-of-my-business-life/', 'snippet': 'When disaster strikes, there are steps to take that can mean the difference between survival and ruin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the spring of 1990, before e-mail, Twitter and instant messaging, if you were going to get information quickly it came by phone. This has led to a favorite saying, “You’re only one phone call from disaster.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Worst Two Weeks of My Business Life', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disasters and Emergencies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Contamination and Poisoning', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salmonella (Bacteria)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Vermont', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-18T11:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Patrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patrick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/277f0570-b890-51a5-b8df-8d4ec5f3a2e7', 'word_count': 1181, 'uri': 'nyt://article/277f0570-b890-51a5-b8df-8d4ec5f3a2e7'}, {'abstract': 'Apple is working with distributors and producers of TV programming in its efforts to reimagine television as it did the cellphone, Brian Stelter reports in The New York Times.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/18/daily-report-apple-works-with-tv-industry-on-grand-vision/', 'snippet': 'Apple is working with distributors and producers of TV programming in its efforts to reimagine television as it did the cellphone, Brian Stelter reports in The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Apple, in its efforts to reimagine television as it did the cellphone, is collaborating with distributors like Time Warner Cable and programmers like the Walt Disney Company on apps that might eliminate the unpleasant parts of TV watching, like bothersome set-top boxes or clunky remote controls, Brian Stelter reports in The New York Times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-superJumbo-v3.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-thumbStandard-v5.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'le