erhanded politician Frank Underwood.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kevin Spacey, a star and an executive producer of the Netflix political thriller “House of Cards,” was nominated on Thursday for an Emmy Awards for lead actor in a drama series for his role as the scheming politician Frank Underwood. “House of Cards” received nine nominations in total, including outstanding drama series, the first such nomination for a Netflix show. Here in excerpts from the conversation, Mr. Spacey talks about the series and the pleasures of being the underhanded Underwood.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/arts/18artsbeat-spacey/18artsbeat-spacey-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/18/arts/18artsbeat-spacey/18artsbeat-spacey-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 833}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/arts/18artsbeat-spacey/18artsbeat-spacey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/arts/18artsbeat-spacey/18artsbeat-spacey-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1998, 'width': 1439, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/18/arts/18artsbeat-spacey/18artsbeat-spacey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/18/arts/18artsbeat-spacey/18artsbeat-spacey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'imag