under way in San Diego, moviedom heads reluctantly to the megaconvention of science fiction, fantasy and horror fans.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/18/comic-con-a-forced-smile-for-the-fans/', 'snippet': 'As Comic-Con International gets under way in San Diego, moviedom heads reluctantly to the megaconvention of science fiction, fantasy and horror fans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN DIEGO – Many film actors, directors, executives and producers look forward to Comic-Con International the way people look forward to stabbing themselves in the eye with the rusty tooth of a can opener. They increasingly spend as little time at the pop culture convention here as possible, flying in and out on corporate jets or helicopters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Comic-Con: A Forced Smile for the Fans', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comic-Con (Convention)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Warner Brothers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Diego (Calif)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-18T16:44:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a3504167-2888-5646-8712-3d7f1e8eb4a2', 'word_count': 316, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a3504167-2888-5646-8712-3d7f1e8eb4a2'}, {'abstract': 'The French cyclist Christophe Riblon appeared to be in disbelief as he won Stage 18 of the Tour de France on Thursday, and Christopher Froome held on to the overall lead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/19/sports/cycling/riblon-wins-stage