understated, such as pearl rings and cuffs with gold finishes, to the in-your-face, like\xa0a pair of Saint Laurent pearl-studded combat boots also adorned with chains and charms. The spike-topped pearls seen on a Valentino clutch and a Tasaki necklace suggest that the gemstone’s next act will appeal to both the Park Avenue set and downtown circles.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Market Report | Pearls Go Punk', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Market Report: Pearls Go Punk', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-18T21:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aca6242b-67b4-5925-a3e4-0a4e693629c9', 'word_count': 81, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aca6242b-67b4-5925-a3e4-0a4e693629c9'}, {'abstract': 'Organized on the model of a factory assembly line, this group show may be the last word in collaboration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/19/arts/design/work.html', 'snippet': 'Organized on the model of a factory assembly line, this group show may be the last word in collaboration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Klaus Von Nichtssagend Gallery', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/GALLERIES4/GALLERIES4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 734, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/GALLERIES4/GALLERIES4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 734}}, {'rank