://article/89a918f3-8160-511d-adf1-a9e0b3acea66'}, {'abstract': 'Billy Campbell plays a New York farmer who was no fan of slavery but against the Civil War, leading an antislavery firebrand to turn the town against him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/19/movies/in-copperhead-opposing-the-civil-war-brings-trouble.html', 'snippet': 'Billy Campbell plays a New York farmer who was no fan of slavery but against the Civil War, leading an antislavery firebrand to turn the town against him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was, apparently, a war to end all subtlety. Ron Maxwell, director of the Civil War drama “Copperhead,” renders everything in capital letters in this story of dissent and repression on the home front. Though the tale, based on a novel by Harold Frederic, remains relevant to our time, the film is too self-conscious and tedious for the message it delivers.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COPPER_SPAN/COPPER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COPPER_SPAN/COPPER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COPPER_SPAN/COPPER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COPPER_SPAN/COPPER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1214, 'width': 1823, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COPPER_SPAN/COPPER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'h