a-documentary-wrapped-in-a-mockumentary.html', 'snippet': 'In “Colossus,” the director, Mark Hendrickson, creates a vérité documentary about an “artificial band” that is all about manipulation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A mindblower of a mockumentary, “Colossus” will leave you reeling in the best of ways, dizzy from a rock ’n’ roll Tilt-A-Whirl that swirls with duplicity and hilarity. At its core is a vérité documentary by a Cockney-spouting producer, Clark Larson, about his “artificial band” of mostly Americans, living for three months in a house in Russia.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COLOSSUS_SPAN/COLOSSUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COLOSSUS_SPAN/COLOSSUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COLOSSUS_SPAN/COLOSSUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COLOSSUS_SPAN/COLOSSUS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1153, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COLOSSUS_SPAN/COLOSSUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COLOSSUS_SPAN/COLOSSUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_COLOSSUS_SPAN/COLOSSUS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Making of a (Fake) Rock Band', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Colossus', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Colossus (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hendrickson, Mark', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-18T22:26:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By David DeWitt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'DeWitt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/482f158d-f8ae-53fe-a150-fe48906b35b7', 'word_count': 266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/482f158d-f8ae-53fe-a150-fe48906b35b7'}, {'abstract': '“Nicky’s Family” documents how Nicholas Winton, now 104, gave up a 1938 skiing holiday to answer a friend’s request for help in Prague and didn’t stop helping until the war’s beginning stopped him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/19/movies/nickys-family-a-true-story-of-heroism.html', 'snippet': '“Nicky’s Family” documents how Nicholas Winton, now 104, gave up a 1938 skiing holiday to answer a friend’s request for help in Prague and didn’t stop helping until the war’s beginning stopped him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1988 a BBC talk show, “That’s Life,” invited Nicholas Winton, then 79, to sit in the front row of the studio audience while his good works were praised. He had saved the lives of 669 children, most of them Jewish, in Nazi-occupied Czechoslovakia with his own personal Kindertransport. The woman sitting next to him at the show was one of them. And if you don’t feel teary when Mr. Winton learns on the air that virtually everyone in the audience that day had been one of those children, you have no heart.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_NICKY_SPAN/NICKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_NICKY_SPAN/NICKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_NICKY_SPAN/NICKY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_NICKY_SPAN/NICKY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1340, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_NICKY_SPAN/NICKY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_NICKY_SPAN/NICKY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_NICKY_SPAN/NICKY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'He Didn’t Save the World, Just 669 Children', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nicky’s Family', 'name': N