rber. For a young Afro-Colombian like Tomas, who is harassed by security guards at the mall, it’s a way of finding strength in a heritage that is all too often used against him.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1242, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/arts/19RDP_LAPLAYA_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Scissors, Shaver and Salvation for a Young Barber', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 