ering a run.', 'lead_paragraph': '11:22 a.m. | Updated  Is Representative Peter King of New York really going to run for president?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Peter King Seeks to Fuel Talk of Presidential Bid', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-19T14:48:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raymond Hernandez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raymond', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hernandez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/88ba29e4-b00f-584d-be5f-eb9747b10865', 'word_count': 344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/88ba29e4-b00f-584d-be5f-eb9747b10865'}, {'abstract': 'Kashmir is under curfew after four slain protesters were buried in Ramban district of the troubled region.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/19/kashmir-seethes-under-curfew-after-troops-kill-four/', 'snippet': 'Kashmir is under curfew after four slain protesters were buried in Ramban district of the troubled region.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The government in the northern state of Jammu and Kashmir imposed a curfew on Kashmir Valley and some districts of Jammu region on Friday after India’s paramilitary Border Security Force troops and local police killed four protesters and injured over 40 in the Ramban district of the state. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/19/world/asia/19-kashmir-protest-IndiaInk/19-kashmir-protest-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/19/world/asia/19-kashmir-protest-IndiaInk/19-kashm