ee Daniels.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weinstein Company Loses Appeal to Use Movie Title ‘The Butler’', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Weinstein Company Loses ‘Butler’ Appeal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Weinstein Co', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Daniels, Lee', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Warner Brothers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Butler (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-20T14:12:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cieply', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cieply', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/500b4c19-fa20-542e-8665-0550c4631b48', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/500b4c19-fa20-542e-8665-0550c4631b48'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Thomas covered every president from John F. Kennedy to Barack Obama, but her career ended ignominiously over remarks she made about Israeli Jews.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/21/business/media/helen-thomas-who-broke-down-barriers-as-white-house-reporter-is-dead-at-92.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Thomas covered every president from John F. Kennedy to Barack Obama, but her career ended ignominiously over remarks she made about Israeli Jews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Helen Thomas, whose keen curiosity, unquenchable drive and celebrated constancy made her a trailblazing White House correspondent in a press corps dominated by men and who was later regarded as the dean of the White House briefing room, died on Saturday at her home in Washington. She was 92.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/us/Obit-Thomas/Obit-Thomas-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 492, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/21/us/Obit-Thomas/Obit-Thomas-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 492}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/us/Obit-Thomas/Obit-Thomas-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 840, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/us/Obit-Thomas/Obit-Thomas-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1680, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/us/Obit-Thomas/Obit-Thomas-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/21/us/Obit-Thomas/Obit-Thomas-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/us/Obit-Thomas/Obit-Thomas-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '50 Years of Tough Questions and ‘Thank You, Mr. President’', 'kicker': 'Helen Thomas | 1920-2013', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '50 Years of Tough Questions And ‘Thank You, Mr. President’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub