effort to steel himself and won the 2013 Masters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/21/sports/golf/scotts-passage-from-forlorn-to-first.html', 'snippet': 'Adam Scott, who squandered a lead in the 2012 British Open, made a concerted effort to steel himself and won the 2013 Masters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GULLANE, Scotland — The calluses that came with Adam Scott’s classic swing hardened his hands, but after his swing failed him in the clutch at last year’s British Open, Scott realized he had much work to do. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/sports/dogGolf/dogGolf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/21/sports/dogGolf/dogGolf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/sports/dogGolf/dogGolf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/sports/dogGolf/dogGolf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/sports/dogGolf/dogGolf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/21/sports/dogGolf/dogGolf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/21/sports/dogGolf/dogGolf-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150