s stood firm on the choice to send all asylum seekers who arrive by boat to Papua New Guinea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/22/world/asia/australia-defends-new-refugee-policy-despite-riot.html', 'snippet': 'Following a riot in Nauru and the first arrival of a vessel under the new policy, senior officials stood firm on the choice to send all asylum seekers who arrive by boat to Papua New Guinea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SYDNEY, Australia — Senior Australian officials on Sunday defended the country’s tough new policy aimed at curtailing the surge of people attempting a dangerous boat journey to claim asylum as the Australian Navy intercepted the first vessel to be subjected to the policy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Australia Defends New Refugee Policy, Despite Riot', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carr, Bob', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rudd, Kevin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-21T09:20:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Siegel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Siegel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/293fd359-c141-5f46-a3f3-63a28da20d18', 'word_count': 586, 'uri': 'nyt://article/293fd359-c141-5f46-a3f3-63a28da20d18'}, {'abstract': 'Before I told my daughter about my adoption, she never had reason to even consider what it would be like to be given up, or given to others. Now she does.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/21/explaining-my-adoption-to-my-biological-daughter/', 'snippet': 'Before I told my daughter about my adoption, she never had reason to even consider what it would be like to be given up, or given to others. Now she does.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Mama, what does adopted mean?” my daughter asked me one day last year, to my great surprise. For some reason I was shocked that she even knew the word. Of course she couldn’t know what it meant, because I had never explained the word, or told her I was adopted—even though as an adoptee, my family and my life have been formed by adoption, and knowledge of it is something I have always taken for granted.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Explaining My Adoption to My Biological Daughter', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADOPTIONS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-21T12:13:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicole S. Chung', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicole', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Chung', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a36c2fd-6c93-5687-b073-e21248f66687', 'word_count': 758, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a36c2fd-6c93-5687-b073-e21248f66687'}, {'abstract': 'Phil Mickelson got hot when Adam Scott and Lee Westwood faltered and won the British Open for the first time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/22/sports/golf/british-open-final-round-muirfield.html', 'snippet': 'Phil Mickelson got hot when Adam Scott and Lee Westwood faltered and won the British Open for the first time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GULLANE, Scotland — On a hard and historic course that has routinely separated the great golfers from the good, greatness had to come from behind Sunday.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/sports/golf/22golf_4/22golf_4-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/22/sports/golf/22golf_4/22golf_4-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/sports/golf/22golf_4/22golf_4-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/sports/golf/22golf_4/22golf_4-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/sports/golf/22golf_4/22golf_4-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/22/sports/golf/22golf_4/22golf_4-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/sports/golf/22golf_4/22golf_4-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mickelson Raises a Jug to Links Golf', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_