elters to advance his mayoral campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/22/nyregion/bloomberg-sues-liu-for-rejecting-city-contracts.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg contends that Comptroller John C. Liu blocked a deal on homeless shelters to advance his mayoral campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fed up with what he views as a pattern of obstructionist behavior, Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg has taken the rare step of filing a lawsuit against the city comptroller, John C. Liu, for rejecting two municipal contracts.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bloomberg Sues Liu for Rejecting City Contracts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mayor Sues\r\nComptroller\r\nOn Contracts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chen, David W', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, John C', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aguila Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homeless Persons', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Upper West Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Bronx (Bronx, NY)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-21T21:46:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David W. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb4b1821-f136-5137-bce6-d21024e75e12', 'word_count': 835, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb4b1821-f136-5137-bce6-d21024e75e12'}, {'abstract': 'Ivy Pochoda’s “Visitation Street” is set in a neighborhood on Brooklyn’s watery edge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/22/books/ivy-pochodas-visitation-street-set-on-brooklyns-edge.html', 'snippet': 'Ivy Pochoda’s “Visitation Street” is set in a neighborhood on Brooklyn’s watery edge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Roast me, if you want, for spoiling Ivy Pochoda’s skillful new thriller, “Visitation Street,” but I’m going to reveal its primary villain: the waters of New York Bay, lapping malevolently against the broken-down shoreline of Red Hook, Brooklyn. In all fairness, that much is obvious from the opening pages, in which Ms. Pochoda describes the water as a “stagnant summer brew of diesel and salt.” She writes later that it “smells like Brooklyn.” That’s not a compliment.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/arts/book/book-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/22/arts/book/book-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/arts/book/book-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 769, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/arts/book/book-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1537, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': '