637, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f3c17eb-8c81-5833-8e73-9d56a7bac7aa'}, {'abstract': 'A Manhattan cellar where 27,000 cases of wine were stored was flooded during Hurricane Sandy, and collectors blocked from assessing the damage have sued.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/22/nyregion/a-vintage-mystery-in-a-flooded-wine-cellar.html', 'snippet': 'A Manhattan cellar where 27,000 cases of wine were stored was flooded during Hurricane Sandy, and collectors blocked from assessing the damage have sued.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WineCare marketed itself as a high-security cellar that stores, catalogs and cares for 27,000 cases of wine in the basement of a Manhattan warehouse, charging substantial fees to safeguard collections worth tens of millions of dollars.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/nyregion/JP-WINE/JP-WINE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/22/nyregion/JP-WINE/JP-WINE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/nyregion/JP-WINE/JP-WINE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/nyregion/JP-WINE/JP-WINE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/nyregion/JP-WINE/JP-WINE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/22/nyregion/JP-WINE/JP