t_headline': 'After Derailment, Metro-North\r\nWill Resume Normal Schedule', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metro-North Commuter Railroad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroad Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Transportation Authority', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Transportation Safety Board', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-22T03:43:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/168218af-c7a2-565b-9804-5bc7d071ee15', 'word_count': 156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/168218af-c7a2-565b-9804-5bc7d071ee15'}, {'abstract': 'Summer brings a bounty of tomatoes. Here are five ways to put them to delicious use.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/22/health/tomatoes-take-center-stage.html', 'snippet': 'Summer brings a bounty of tomatoes. Here are five ways to put them to delicious use.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whenever July rolls around I look forward to testing recipes for what is now my annual Recipes for Health tomato week. My own tomatoes are ripening on the vine, and tomatoes are the main event at farmers’ markets. There is little room in my repertoire at this time of year for dishes that don’t include tomatoes, but this week I kept it pretty simple. As I experienced the pleasure of one of the many tomato sandwiches I made, I wondered why I bother ordering club sandwiches or anything with fresh tomatoes at any other time of year; I usually don’t but sometimes I’m confronted with a menu that doesn’t give me much of a choice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/science/sub22recipehealth/sub22recipehealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/22/science/sub22recipehealth/sub22recipehealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/science/sub22recipehealth/sub22recipehealth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/science/sub22recipehealth/sub22recipehealth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/science/sub22recipehealth/sub22recipehealth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/22/science/sub22recipehealth/sub22recipehealth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/22/science/sub22recipehealth/sub22recipehealth-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tomatoes Take Center Stage', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-22T03:59:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha Rose Shulman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': 'Rose', 'lastname': 'Shulman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported'