 strike down section 4 of the Voting Rights Act. On June 26, he railed against the majority’s decision to strike down section 3 of DOMA, arguing that the Supreme Court has “no power under the Constitution to invalidate this democratically adopted legislation.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scalia’s Latest Outburst', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scalia, Antonin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-22T16:43:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Lapidos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lapidos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bc0b1976-c18e-5488-9267-d47e05982657', 'word_count': 264, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bc0b1976-c18e-5488-9267-d47e05982657'}, {'abstract': 'DanceMotion USA, a cultural diplomacy program produced by the Brooklyn Academy of Music, will send the Mark Morris Dance Group, David Dorfman Dance and Contra-Tiempo to perform at destinations around the globe next year.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/22/dance-troupes-to-tour-asia-and-south-america/', 'snippet': 'DanceMotion USA, a cultural diplomacy program produced by the Brooklyn Academy of Music, will send the Mark Morris Dance Group, David Dorfman Dance and Contra-Tiempo to perform at destinations around the globe next year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DanceMotion USA, a cultural diplomacy and exchange program produced by the Brooklyn Academy of Music, has selected David Dorfman Dance, Contra-Tiempo and the Mark Morris Dance Group for its fourth season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dance Troupes to Tour Asia and South America', 