oit is in much deeper trouble. Its trip through bankruptcy will be in uncharted territory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When cities and other municipalities file for bankruptcy, it is typically a staid affair. At least by bankruptcy standards.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Detroit Blazes a Path It Never Wanted', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-22T17:57:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen J. Lubben', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Lubben', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa56e1cf-2b73-5911-98e7-77dee5639728', 'word_count': 440, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa56e1cf-2b73-5911-98e7-77dee5639728'}, {'abstract': 'Innovation is being encouraged at the local level, in a push to get new ideas in front of guests and learn from their feedback.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/23/business/hotels-look-to-stand-out-in-a-sea-of-uniformity.html', 'snippet': 'Innovation is being encouraged at the local level, in a push to get new ideas in front of guests and learn from their feedback.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the Wyndham Grand Orlando hotel in Florida, meals are created with some of the latest culinary technologies, including anti-griddles, liquid nitrogen tanks and Pacojets. Guests at the Hyatt Regency Santa Clara are trying out a new booth for soundproof worldwide teleconferencing. If these new features go over well with customers, they will stay.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'