ashev, who admitted killing three people with Tamerlan Tsarnaev in 2011.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The American Civil Liberties Union on Monday urged local law enforcement officials in Florida and Massachusetts to open investigations into how an F.B.I. agent killed a man who was being interrogated in his Orlando apartment about the Boston Marathon bombing suspects.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A.C.L.U. Urges Inquiries in Shooting of Man Tied to Boston Suspect', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Florida: Inquiry Urged in Death During Interrogation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmidt, Michael S', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Todashev, Ibragim', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Civil Liberties Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsarnaev, Tamerlan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon Bombings (2013)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Orlando (Fla)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-22T18:59:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael S. Schmidt and Charlie Savage', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Schmidt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'ran