s, Gail Kreitman, over differences between statements made in 2009 and while on the stand.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/07/22/tourre-lawyers-focus-on-reliability-of-federal-witness/', 'snippet': 'Lawyers for the former Goldman Sachs trader Fabrice Tourre tried to cast doubt on the witness, Gail Kreitman, over differences between statements made in 2009 and while on the stand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than six years ago, Gail Kreitman contacted a former colleague to pitch a new debt investment that her employer at the time, Goldman Sachs, was putting together.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tourre Lawyers Focus on Reliability of Federal Witness', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tourre Lawyers Focus on Reliability of Federal Witness', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Securities and Commodities Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tourre, Fabrice P', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ACA  Financial Guaranty Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paulson & Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-23T00:47:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced and Susanne Craig', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Craig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31901a88-1966-5d12-8f96-c1228b40ad33', 'word_count': 822, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31901a88-1966-5d12-8f96-c1228b40ad33'}, {'abstract': 'Torrents of water shooting out from beneath the thinning Mendenhall Glacier have become a new element of Juneau’s brief, high summer season, threatening property.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/23/us/alaska-looks-for-answers-in-glaciers-summer-flood-surges.html', 'snippet': 'Torrents of water shooting out from beneath the thinning Mendenhall Glacier have become a new element of Juneau’s brief, high summer season, threatening property.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JUNEAU, Alaska — The idea that glaciers change at a glacial speed is increasingly false. They are melting and retreating rapidly all over the world. But the unpredictable flood surges at the Mendenhall Glacier, about 14 miles from downtown Juneau, Alaska’s capital, are turning a jog into a sprint as global temperatures and climate variability increase.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/23/us/GLACIER-1/GLACIER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/23/us/GLACIER-1/GLACIER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/23/us/GLACIER-1/GLACIER-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/23/us/GLACIER-1/GLACIER-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit'