tary’s ouster of President Mohamed Morsi nearly three weeks ago would quickly provide the security that Egypt’s generals covet.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/world/24egypt_span/24egypt_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/24/world/24egypt_span/24egypt_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/world/24egypt_span/24egypt_span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/world/24egypt_span/24egypt_span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/world/24egypt_span/24egypt_span-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/24/world/24egypt_span/24egypt_span-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/world/24egypt_span/24egypt_span-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '12 Die in Clashes in Egypt as New Leaders Find Security Elusive', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '12 Die in Clashes in Egypt as New Leaders Find Security Elusive', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fahim, Kareem', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morsi, Mohamed', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Muslim Brotherhood (Egypt)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mansour, Adli', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ElBaradei, Mohamed', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-23T13:23:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kareem Fahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kareem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f1b6f7c-43b9-57ae-a190-c204b9f05f35', 'word_count': 719, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f1b6f7c-43b9-57ae-a190-c204b9f05f35'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Baron Cohen, known for reality-based comedies like “Borat” and “Bruno,” has fallen out due to that crazy little thing called creative differences.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/23/sacha-baron-cohen-withdraws-from-freddie-mercury-movie/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Baron Cohen, known for reality-based comedies like “Borat” and “Bruno,” has fallen out due to that crazy little thing called creative differences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He had paid his dues, time after time, done his sentence but committed no crime — and yet, Sacha Baron Cohen will not be portraying Freddie Mercury in a coming biographical film. The project, which raised eyebrows when it was announced in 2010, would have seen Mr. Baron Cohen play Mercury, the flamboyant rock star and front man of Queen, in the era surrounding that band’s performance at the 1985 Live Aid benefit concert. (Though Mr. Baron Cohen is better known for reality-based comedies like “Borat” and “Bruno,” he has sung in movies like “Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street” and “Les Misérables” and is certainly capable of growing a mustache.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/23/arts/mercury/mercury-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 262, 'width': 395, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/23/arts/mercury/mercury-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 262, 'width': 395, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/23/arts/mercury/mercury-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/23/arts/mercury/mercury-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sacha Baron Cohen Withdraws From Freddie Mercury Movie', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cohen, Sacha Baron', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mercury, Freddie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Queen (Music Group)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-23T13:26:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b97d3a83-8364-5c67-b0fd-763a1bf8926a', 'word_count': 201, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b97d3a83-8364-5c67-b0fd-763a1bf8926a'}, {'abstract': 'The Supreme Court on Monday overturned the Bombay High Court’s suspension of a law dealing with tobacco advertising in shops.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/23/supreme-court-restricts-tobacco-advertising/', 'snippet': 'The Supreme Court on Monday overturned the Bombay High Court’s suspension of a law dealing with tobacco advertising in shops.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Supreme Court of India has overturned a lower court’s suspension of a law regulating the promotion of tobacco products and criticized the central government for doing nothing to get the interim order revoked since it was issued in 2005.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/23/world/asia/23-cigarette-IndiaInk/23-cigarette-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/23/world/asia/23-cigarette-IndiaInk/23-cigarette-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/23/world/asia/23-cigarette-IndiaInk/23-cigarette-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/23/world/asia/23-cigarette-IndiaInk/23-cigarette-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'super