n novels are on the longlist for the Man Booker Prize, considered Britain’s most prestigious literary award.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The administrators of the Man Booker Prize released its longlist for this year’s award on Tuesday, a list of 13 novels that was notable for its diversity. The Booker is Britain’s most prestigious literary award, given to an author in the former British Commonwealth, Ireland or Zimbabwe for what the judges consider the finest novel of the year.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Booker Prize Nominees Are Released', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Booker Prize Nominees Are Named in Longlist', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Man Booker Prize', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-23T16:25:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6e76d78a-d5a7-5a93-81f8-74180eeb504f', 'word_count': 208, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6e76d78a-d5a7-5a93-81f8-74180eeb504f'}, {'abstract': 'This method of roasting won’t dry out the tomatoes completely but will intensify everything about them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/26/health/amazingly-sweet-slow-roasted-tomatoes.html', 'snippet': 'This method of roasting won’t dry out the tomatoes completely but will intensify everything about them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'These don’t look like they are going to taste as amazing as they do, and I know it might be asking a lot to have the oven on for 2 hours on a hot summer day. But it’s on low and the end result will be worth it. Lean over the plate when you bite into the tomatoes, as the juice may squirt. You can eat these as a snack or a side dish, or put them through a food mill for an incredibly sweet sauce.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/science/26recipehealth/26recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 424, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/24/science/26recipehealth/26recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 424}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/science/26recipehealth/26recipehealth-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/science/26recipehealth/26recipehealth-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1448, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/science/26recipehealth/26recipehealth-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/24/science/26recipehealth/26recipehealth-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/science/26recipehealth/26recipehealth-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cro