 nine people were killed over the last 24 hours during clashes between supporters and opponents of the deposed Islamist president, Mohamed Morsi, in central Cairo, around Cairo University in Giza and north of the city in the Nile Delta.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video of Deadly Violence in Cairo', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morsi, Mohamed', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cairo (Egypt)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Giza (Egypt)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-23T23:26:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liam Stack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/066ef4c7-57d8-51bc-8d55-56b16516ea0f', 'word_count': 392, 'uri': 'nyt://article/066ef4c7-57d8-51bc-8d55-56b16516ea0f'}, {'abstract': 'At companies like PepsiCo and Kellogg, white-coated lab technicians join with white-jacketed chefs to give consumers the taste they want with less salt, fat and sugar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/24/business/food-corporations-turn-to-chefs-in-a-quest-for-healthy-flavor.html', 'snippet': 'At companies like PepsiCo and Kellogg, white-coated lab technicians join with white-jacketed chefs to give consumers the taste they want with less salt, fat and sugar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. HELENA, Calif. — The chicken thighs, smoked for two hours, then soaked in buttermilk spiked with Crystal hot sauce and dredged in flour, turned a perfect golden brown, full of the promise of succulence and crunch, under the stern watch of Chef H. Alexander Talbot.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Food Corporations Turn to Chefs in a Quest for Healthy Flavor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cooking in the Lab', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strom, Stephanie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taste', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pepsico Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Culinary Institute of America', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-23T23:31:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Strom', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strom', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/14a9d673-9a57-58b8-af86-6eb3d7e0af30', 'word_count': 1545, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14a9d673-9a57-58b8-af86-6eb3d7e0af30'}, {'abstract': 'A recent workshop at the Culinary Institute of America highlights recent efforts by companies to develop flavorful foods that are lower in fat, salt and sugar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/07/24/business/24food-ss.html', 'snippet': 'A recent workshop at the Culinary Institute of America highlights recent efforts by companies to develop flavorful foods that are lower in fat, salt and sugar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A recent workshop at the Culinary Institute of America highlights recent efforts by companies to develop flavo