-in-court-debate-life-term-or-death-for-a-killer-of-2-detectives.html', 'snippet': 'Ronell Wilson was convicted of shooting two undercover detectives point-blank in Staten Island in 2003.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a month of testimony in the death-penalty trial of Ronell Wilson, who killed two New York City police detectives in a failed gun sting operation a decade ago, lawyers made their closing arguments on Tuesday in passionate speeches that invoked life and death, and responsibility and justice.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Passionate Speeches in Court Over Life Term or Death for a Killer of 2 Detectives', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Passionate Speeches in Court Over Life Term or Death for a Killer of 2 Detectives', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Ronell', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Secret, Mosi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Staten Island (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nemorin, James V', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Andrews, Rodney J', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-24T01:23:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mosi Secret', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mosi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Secret', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'ra