 the weekend they were part of a show involving a host of historic tanks and armored vehicles.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/24/world-war-ii-tanks-roll-i-france-again/', 'snippet': 'Seventy years ago, German Panzer tanks would have been a terrifying sight in western France. But over the weekend they were part of a show involving a host of historic tanks and armored vehicles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAUMUR, France – On a quiet Friday afternoon in western France, German Panzer tanks rolled out at a quick pace. They didn’t go unchallenged. They were met by British Stuart and American Sherman tanks, as well as some impressive armored vehicles that once packed plenty of firepower.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/T34-tank/T34-tank-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/T34-tank/T34-tank-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/T34-tank/T34-tank-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 577, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/T34-tank/T34-tank-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/T34-tank/T34-tank-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/T34-tank/T34-tank-thumbStandard.jpg', 'th