, a club that opened in May in the meatpacking district, where the music is loud and the crowd likes to flaunt its wealth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/fashion/manon-a-vast-ornate-club-in-the-meatpacking-district.html', 'snippet': 'Manon, a club that opened in May in the meatpacking district, where the music is loud and the crowd likes to flaunt its wealth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A quieter, less outré meatpacking district? Not at Manon, a vast and ornate trilevel club that opened in May, where the music is loud, the drinks are expensive and the crowd likes to flaunt its wealth.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/fashion/25BOITE/25zBOITE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/25/fashion/25BOITE/25zBOITE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/fashion/25BOITE/25zBOITE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/fashion/25BOITE/25zBOITE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/fashion/25BOITE/25zBOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/25/fashion/25BOITE/25zBOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/fashion/25BOITE/25zBOITE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Manon, a Vast, Ornate Club in the Meatpacking District', 'kicker': 'Boîte', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Manon | Meatpacking District', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Meatpacking District (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manon (Manhattan, NY, Nightclub)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-24T19:28:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joshua David Stein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joshua', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Stein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e37446f-9cf4-5a0b-bc7f-2851fa550a80', 'word_count': 345, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e37446f-9cf4-5a0b-bc7f-2851fa550a80'}, {'abstract': 'Exclusive: T hosts the premiere of the bizarro stop-motion music video for outré Berlin-based garage band.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/24/listen-up-the-strange-soul-circus-of-king-khan-and-the-shrines/', 'snippet': 'Exclusive: T hosts the premiere of the bizarro stop-motion music video for outré Berlin-based garage band.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The surreal stop-motion video for the song “Darkness” by the psychedelic soul band King Khan and the Shrines, which has its world premiere here, deals with some heavy issues: life, death, what it’s like to be shot out of a cannon. For Arish Ahmad Khan, the band’s Berlin-based, Montreal-born, Indian frontman, the themes and aesthetics of the clip, created by the five-person German animation collective Hylas, were a perfect match for his own. “I would go in their workshop and watch them film three seconds in eight hours,” he said. “It was fascinating.” Hylas adapted the video, which features a strongman with a mohawk and a mysterious Native American shaman in addition to the human cannon fodder, from their continuing stop-motion series called “Circus,” about a traveling circus trapped in a strange place. “They first shot the piece as an experiment for another project,” Khan explained. “When they showed it to me I fell in love with it, so we added another 30 seconds and made into the music video.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Listen Up | The Strange Soul Circus of King Khan and the Shrines', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-24T19:30:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rob Ledonne', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ledonne', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eaa90038-c40a-5c46-b1f4-bdcf2eab9670', 'word_count': 273, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eaa90038-c40a-5c46-b1f4-bdcf2eab9670'}, {'abstract': 'The audience conducts and consumes the interview for Reddit’s Ask Me Anything series.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/fashion/reddits-wide-audience-drives-the-interview.html', 'snippet': 'The audience conducts and consumes the interview for Reddit’s Ask Me Anything series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Snoop Dogg was asked how much marijuana he has smoked in his life. (“how big is mt rushmore?” he replied.) Seth Rogen was asked if had luck with the ladies in high school. (“No,” he said.)', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'so