: 'A high-speed passenger train crashed in northwestern Spain on Wednesday night, killing at least 77 people and leaving at least 100 injured, according to judicial sources and local news reports.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/world/europe/scores-are-feared-dead-as-high-speed-train-derails-in-spain.html', 'snippet': 'A high-speed passenger train crashed in northwestern Spain on Wednesday night, killing at least 77 people and leaving at least 100 injured, according to judicial sources and local news reports.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A high-speed passenger train that was reportedly traveling at more than double the speed limit derailed just outside a station in northwest Spain on Wednesday evening, killing at least 60 of those on board, according to local news reports. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scores Reported Dead as Train Derails in Spain', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dozens Are Feared Dead as High-Speed Train Derails in Spain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroad Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robles, Frances', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-25T00:56:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya and Frances Robles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Frances', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/775e88c5-b228-5a7c-a122-98a3a09d06f9', 'word_count': 542, 'uri': 'nyt://article/775e88c5-b228-5a7c-a122-98a3a09d06f9'}, {'abstract': 'America must live up to its values and impose sanctions against Ethiopia’s reckless and undemocratic government.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/opinion/letter-from-ethiopias-gulag.html', 'snippet': 'America must live up to its values and impose sanctions against Ethiopia’s reckless and undemocratic government.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ADDIS ABABA, Ethiopia — I AM jailed, with around 200 other inmates, in a wide hall that looks like a warehouse. For all of us, there are only three toilets. Most of the inmates sleep on the floor, which has never been swept. About 1,000 prisoners share the small open space here at Kaliti Prison. One can guess our fate if a communicable disease breaks out.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Letter From Ethiopia’s Gulag', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Letter From Ethiopia’s Gulag', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nega, Eskinder', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ethiopia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of the Press', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-25T00:57:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eskinder Nega', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eskinder', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nega', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization':