nyt://article/843e2f8e-8f16-530c-9451-a2447e7d4a84'}, {'abstract': '“Me and Jezebel,” at the Snapple Theater Center, is based on Elizabeth Fuller’s memoir of a time in 1985 when Bette Davis came to her home to stay and stay and stay.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/theater/reviews/bette-davis-stays-and-stays-in-me-and-jezebel.html', 'snippet': '“Me and Jezebel,” at the Snapple Theater Center, is based on Elizabeth Fuller’s memoir of a time in 1985 when Bette Davis came to her home to stay and stay and stay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Bette-Davis-in-her-70s look is just right: the too-perfect pageboy, the oversize glasses, the Chanel (or at least Chanel-like) suit. And the voice is good — husky, imperious but lyrical, with the precise, signature caesuras. Kelly Moore (Mr. Kelly Moore, as the program wants to be sure we know) is great fun to watch as Davis in Elizabeth Fuller’s “Me and Jezebel,” adapted from her memoir. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/arts/meandjezebel/meandjezebel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/25/arts/meandjezebel/meandjezebel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/arts/meandjezebel/meandjezebel-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 492, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/arts/meandjezebel/meandjezebel-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 492, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'ima