this season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/sports/baseball/pettittes-strong-outing-wasted-by-weakened-yankees-offense.html', 'snippet': 'Andy Pettitte allowed two runs in six-plus innings but got little run support as his record dropped to 7-8 this season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ARLINGTON, Tex. — Andy Pettitte is always one to nitpick and parse his way through his games to find the flaws, even if they are scarce. So on Wednesday, after all the hard work he did to blaze through a lineup of dangerous right-handed hitters, Pettitte agonized over the hit he gave up to a left-hander.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/sports/baseball/25yankeesgamer1-img/25yankeesgamer1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 536, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/25/sports/baseball/25yankeesgamer1-img/25yankeesgamer1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 536}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/sports/baseball/25yankeesgamer1-img/25yankeesgamer1-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 915, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/sports/baseball/25yankeesgamer1-img/25yankeesgamer1-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1830, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/sports/baseball/25yankeesgamer1-img/25yankeesgamer1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/25/sports/baseball/25yankeesgamer1-img/25yankeesgamer1-img-thumbStandar