rticle/b761e75d-6606-5652-8d2f-588f90e27717', 'word_count': 138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b761e75d-6606-5652-8d2f-588f90e27717'}, {'abstract': 'Hyundai has redesigned the 2014 Equus, offering a large car that is quiet, comfortable and powerful. But is it ready for competition against other luxury segment marques?', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/the-2014-hyundai-equus-nondescript-country-club-comfort-at-a-competitive-price/', 'snippet': 'Hyundai has redesigned the 2014 Equus, offering a large car that is quiet, comfortable and powerful. But is it ready for competition against other luxury segment marques?', 'lead_paragraph': 'What luxury means to different people depends upon a variety of things: where they’re from, how wealthy they are, whether or not they care much about what other people think and so on. Hyundai, which brought its 2014 Equus luxury sedan in New York City Wednesday, seems to be going for the market where comfort and price matter, but overtly impressing other people doesn’t.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/equus-5/equus-5-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 319, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/equus-5/equus-5-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 319}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/equus-5/equus-5-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 545, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/24/automobiles/wheels/equus-5/equus-5-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1090, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 't