ame': 'persons', 'value': 'Beame, Abraham D', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berger, Stephen', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ravitch, Richard', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rohatyn, Felix G', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shanker, Albert', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-25T17:34:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/054a6569-2903-5c1b-b7f9-8c56b54847e1', 'word_count': 964, 'uri': 'nyt://article/054a6569-2903-5c1b-b7f9-8c56b54847e1'}, {'abstract': 'The playwright and activist married his longtime partner, David Webster, on Wednesday, days after undergoing surgery at NYU Langone Medical Center.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/larry-kramer-is-married-in-hospital-ceremony/', 'snippet': 'The playwright and activist married his longtime partner, David Webster, on Wednesday, days after undergoing surgery at NYU Langone Medical Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Larry Kramer, the award-winning playwright of “The Normal Heart” and longtime gay rights advocate, married his partner, David Webster, on Wednesday in the intensive care unit of NYU Langone Medical Center, where Mr. Kramer has been recovering from surgery for a bowel obstruction. Mr. Webster, in a telephone interview on Thursday, said the couple had set the wedding date a few weeks earlier, before Mr. Kramer’s health flare-up.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26artsbeat-kramer/26artsbeat-kramer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26artsbeat-kramer/26artsbeat-kramer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26artsbeat-kramer/26artsbeat-kramer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26artsbeat-kramer/26artsbeat-kramer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 1280, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26artsbeat-kramer/26artsbeat-kramer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26artsbeat-kramer/26artsbeat-kramer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26artsbeat-kramer/26artsbeat-kramer-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Larry Kramer Is Married in Hospital Ceremony', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Larry Kramer Is Married  In Hospital Ceremony', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kramer, Larry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-25T17:35:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fee7378-0cb2-561b-9c65-9636332fa3ce', 'word_count': 453, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fee7378-0cb2-561b-9c65-9636332fa3ce'}, {'abstract': 'In his debut novel, Matt Bell describes the trajectory of a relationship between a man and a woman in an unnamed land.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/26/books/matt-bells-in-the-house-upon-the-dirt-between-the-lake-and-the-woods.html', 'snippet': 'In his debut novel, Matt Bell describes the trajectory of a relationship between a man and a woman in an unnamed land.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A newly married couple, flush with love and possibility, leave everyone and everything they know to forge a life for themselves. But not long after they move into their new house, their infatuation fades. Carefree youthful courtship is replaced by the burdens of adult responsibility. The wife, who grew up in an abusive household, finds herself subjected to her husband’s abuse. She has multiple miscarriages, but he keeps pressuring her to try to have children. When she conceives again, he convinces himself that she is faking her pregnancy; and when she gives birth, he is certain that the child is not his. As the wife devotes herself to her child, the husband grows jealous. Jealousy and estrangement lead to separation; the husband succumbs to violent and self-destructive impulses and fantasies. Only many years and trials later do the husband and wife arrive at some sort of hard-won reconciliation. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/books/26book-1/