cret gadgets be?', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/what-are-apples-upcoming-amazing-new-products/', 'snippet': 'Timothy D. Cook, Apple’s chief executive, alluded to “amazing new products” that the company will introduce in the fall and across 2014. What could these secret gadgets be?', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday, Timothy D. Cook, Apple’s chief executive, again teased tech blogs about new Apple gadgetry.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/technology/bits-timcook/bits-timcook-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/technology/bits-timcook/bits-timcook-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/technology/bits-timcook/bits-timcook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/25/technology/bits-timcook/bits-timcook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/25/technology/bits-timcook/bits-timcook-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What Are Apple’s ‘Amazing’ New Products?', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-25T18:51:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton and Brian X. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/91fef17c-ce6e-5c6c-b89a-67aa0e1d23b3', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/91fef17c-ce6e-5c6c-b89a-67aa0e1d23b3'}, {'abstract': 'Inequality or excess leverage?', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/25/stiglitz-minsky-and-obama/', 'snippet': 'Inequality or excess leverage?', 'lead_paragraph': 'I haven’t commented so far on the president’s economic speech, except to mock the journalists demanding “new ideas” for a very old-fashioned economic crisis. And as many people have pointed out, there weren’t any actual policy proposals.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stiglitz, Minsky, and Obama', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-25T18:56:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f214259-a552-55c7-a728-11ee50db7eb2', 'word_count': 451, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f214259-a552-55c7-a728-11ee50db7eb2'}, {'abstract': 'Feast searches for a midpoint between the tasting menu and the humble satisfactions of a smorgasbord.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/31/dining/reviews/hungry-city-feast-in-the-east-village.html', 'snippet': 'Feast searches for a midpoint between the tasting menu and the humble satisfactions of a smorgasbord.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I did not expect the dish described as “bacon and egg” to appear in a tart shell the size of my palm. It was three mouthfuls at most, of pork belly in repose on creamy grits, with a puffy poached quail egg like a stranded cloud on top. Cute, I thought, and then I took a bite. Strike that: it was debauched, a welcome flicker of deviltry in an otherwise rather regimented restaurant.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/dining/31HUNGRY_SPAN/31HUNGRY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/31/dining/31HUNGRY_SPAN/31HUNGRY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/dining/31HUNGRY_SPAN/31HUNGRY_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/dining/31HUNGRY_SPAN/31HUNGRY_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/dining/31HUNGRY_SPAN/31HUNGRY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/31/dining/31HUNGRY_SPAN/31HUNGRY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/dining/31HUNGRY_SPAN/31HUNGRY_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subT