of Doors, which presented a premiere of Mark Dendy’s “Ritual Cyclical.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hundreds of people crammed the northeast corner of Hearst Plaza on Wednesday night to see the world premiere of Mark Dendy’s “Ritual Cyclical” at Lincoln Center Out of Doors. Here was a show, with 80 dancers, specializing in simultaneous multiplicity. At one time there were four, perhaps six, group dances happening. No spectator could have seen everything that was going on. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26RITUAL_SPAN/JPRITUAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26RITUAL_SPAN/JPRITUAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26RITUAL_SPAN/JPRITUAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26RITUAL_SPAN/JPRITUAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1260, 'width': 1892, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26RITUAL_SPAN/26RITUAL_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26RITUAL_SPAN/26RITUAL_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/arts/26RITUAL_SPAN/26RITUAL_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width'