ain': 'HPV Vaccine Not Reaching Enough Girls, C.D.C. Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'HPV Vaccine Not Reaching Enough Girls, C.D.C. Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tavernise, Sabrina', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Papilloma Virus (HPV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cervical Cancer', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-26T03:41:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sabrina Tavernise', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sabrina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tavernise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e758d2b2-e71d-5dde-b89f-6a1475ac7f18', 'word_count': 465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e758d2b2-e71d-5dde-b89f-6a1475ac7f18'}, {'abstract': 'Four more women said Thursday that they had been subject to unwanted sexual advances by Mayor Bob Filner of San Diego.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/26/us/politics/california-outcry-against-mayor-grows.html', 'snippet': 'Four more women said Thursday that they had been subject to unwanted sexual advances by Mayor Bob Filner of San Diego.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four more women said Thursday that they had been subject to unwanted sexual advances by Mayor Bob Filner of San Diego, as the San Diego County Democratic Party joined the chorus of Democrats demanding his resignation. The women — who include a dean at San Diego State University and a retired Navy rear admiral — made their accusations in interviews with KPBS News. A total of seven women have said they were mistreated by the mayor. Despite crumbling support, Mr. Filner has said he would not step down. He has acknowledged inappropriate behavior but has said he is not guilty of sexual harassment. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'California: Outcry Against Mayor Grows', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | West', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'California: Outcry Against Mayor Grows', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Filner, Bob', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Diego (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-26T03:47:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Nagourney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nagourney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e76a4eb-37b5-5a1b-811c-81451912c5d2', 'word_count': 103, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e76a4eb-37b5-5a1b-811c-81451912c5d2'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama is right to assert that reducing income inequality will help spur growth, an economist writes.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/26/growth-from-the-middle-out-and-how-it-works/', 'snippet': 'President Obama is right to assert that reducing income inequality will help spur growth, an economist writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jared Bernstein is a senior fellow at the Center on Budget and Policy Priorities in Washington and a former chief economist to Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr.', 'source': 'The New