or Friday and the weekend: a powpow at a Queens farm, a Coney Island talent show and a honky-tonk in Harlem.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/26/new-york-today-the-beat-goes-on/', 'snippet': 'What you need to know for Friday and the weekend: a powpow at a Queens farm, a Coney Island talent show and a honky-tonk in Harlem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The thud, thud, thud of an American Indian powwow drum will boom from Queens on Friday night and all weekend.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/nyregion/NewYorkToday/NewYorkToday-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/26/nyregion/NewYorkToday/NewYorkToday-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/nyregion/NewYorkToday/NewYorkToday-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 643, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/nyregion/NewYorkToday/NewYorkToday-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 643, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/nyregion/NewYorkToday/NewYorkToday-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/26/nyregion/NewYorkToday/NewYorkToday-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/nyregion/NewYorkToday/NewYorkToday-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width