url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/07/26/morning-agenda-criminal-charges-against-sac/', 'snippet': 'Federal authorities delivered a crippling blow to SAC Capital Advisors. | Activision Blizzard has a reached an $8.2 billion deal to separate from Vivendi. | The indictment of a hacking ring rekindles fears that the financial system is vulnerable t...', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAC IS CALLED A MAGNET FOR CHEATING \xa0|\xa0 Federal authorities delivered a crippling blow to SAC Capital Advisors on Thursday, announcing criminal charges against the hedge fund that could threaten its survival, DealBook’s Peter Lattman and Ben Protess report. Calling SAC “a veritable magnet of market cheaters,” the authorities argued that the firm and its units permitted a “systematic” insider trading scheme to unfold from 1999 to 2010, generating hundreds of millions of dollars in profit for the firm, owned by the billionaire Steven A. Cohen.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Criminal Charges Against SAC', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-26T11:40:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9cca9a6-79b0-59b9-a097-e0d70f65684c', 'word_count': 1853, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9cca9a6-79b0-59b9-a097-e0d70f65684c'}, {'abstract': 'An actress explores failure and denial in Bollywood.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/26/failure-in-bollywood/', 'snippet': 'An actress explores failure and denial in Bollywood.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The tragic suicide of the Bollywood actress Jiah Khan in June got me thinking about my own short-lived foray into Bollywood. I was 22 years old and tired of my first desk job as a research analyst at a small corporate ratings company in New York City. I decided to take some time away from the United States and was traveling through India when I decided I wanted to be a Bollywood star.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/world/asia/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/26/world/asia/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/world/asia/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/world/asia/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1462, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/world/asia/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/26/world/asia/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/world/asia/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk/26-salman-khan-IndiaInk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType':