d0a3'}, {'abstract': 'The gingham patterns and ruby red accessories that Dorothy made iconic are everywhere you look this season.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/26/market-report-these-pieces-are-not-in-kansas-anymore/', 'snippet': 'The gingham patterns and ruby red accessories that Dorothy made iconic are everywhere you look this season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Girly ginghams and ruby red accessories have gone well together since Dorothy was swept off by the cyclone. But this season designers, perhaps inspired by last winter’s “Oz” prequel, have brought back the glam-picnic aesthetic in a big way. Prada updated the classic check pattern with a slim-line sheath and oversize buttons, while Opening Ceremony used it to adorn its cat-eye sunglasses. Meanwhile, Valentino released a pair of sparkly pumps that will surely make you want to click your heels together.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Market Report | These Pieces Are Not in Kansas Anymore', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-26T15:11:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/13b97fd1-0835-5f22-9f28-ba8265e6ddd7', 'word_count': 84, 'uri': 'nyt://article/13b97fd1-0835-5f22-9f28-ba8265e6ddd7'}, {'abstract': 'Tribute was paid to martyrs of the 1999 Kargil war fought with Pakistan, at the India Gate memorial in New Delhi.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/26/image-of-the-day-july-26-2/', 'snippet': 'Tribute was paid to martyrs of the 1999 Kargil war fought with Pakistan, at the India Gate memorial i