1e-2425-5619-bcdd-296de370604b', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/9d3ab01e-2425-5619-bcdd-296de370604b'}, {'abstract': 'There’s money to be made by investing in energy, everyone is saying. But as the field grows, how do you separate winners from flashes in the pan?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/27/your-money/asset-allocation/seeking-light-amid-the-heat-of-energy-investments.html', 'snippet': 'There’s money to be made by investing in energy, everyone is saying. But as the field grows, how do you separate winners from flashes in the pan?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Energy independence. Oil exports. Fracking. Electric cars. Solar power. And as of last week: the heat dome. These are phrases that are bandied about, sometimes dividing people along political lines. But all mean one thing: this is a boom time for the United States energy sector, from pulling it out of the ground to moving it around the country to finding ways to use less of it.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/27/business/WEALTH/WEALTH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/27/business/WEALTH/WEALTH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/27/business/WEALTH/WEALTH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/27/business/WEALTH/WEALTH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/