ecutors as revenge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/27/us/death-penalty-sought-in-case-of-killing-of-texas-prosecutors.html', 'snippet': 'Prosecutors in Kaufman County announced Friday they would seek the death penalty against Eric L. Williams, the former justice of the peace accused of murdering two prosecutors as revenge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — Prosecutors in Kaufman County announced Friday they would seek the death penalty against Eric L. Williams, the former justice of the peace accused of murdering two prosecutors as revenge for handling a case against him that led to his removal from office and the suspension of his law license.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Death Penalty Sought in Case of Killing of Texas Prosecutors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Texas: Execution Sought for Ex-Justice of the Peace', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fernandez, Manny', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Eric Lyle', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kaufman County (Tex)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McLelland, Cynthia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Kim Lene', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McLelland, Mike', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hasse, Mark E', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-26T18:17:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manny Fernandez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fernandez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f6ddff7-26e3-5ba5-b6af-1ff3d17d2667', 'word_count': 506, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f6ddff7-26e3-5ba5-b6af-1ff3d17d2667'}, {'abstract': 'The new documentary “Our Nixon” makes use of hundreds of reels of home movies shot by White House staff members.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/movies/our-nixon-uses-hundreds-of-reels-shot-by-staff-members.html', 'snippet': 'The new documentary “Our Nixon” makes use of hundreds of reels of home movies shot by White House staff members.', 'lead_paragraph': 'These days, Dwight Chapin shoots movies on his iPad. But in the Richard M. Nixon White House, he and his colleagues John Ehrlichman and H. R. Haldeman were Super 8-wielding auteurs, capturing intimate moments that eluded the press corps: Tricia Nixon before her wedding; the president in Beijing enjoying a ballet about a workers’ insurrection; Pope Paul VI shot sideways (because Haldeman had smuggled his camera into the Vatican).', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/arts/28NIXON3_SPAN/28NIXON3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/28/arts/28NIXON3_SPAN/28NIXON3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/arts/28NIXON3_SPAN/28NIXON3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/arts/28NIXON3_SPAN/28NIXON3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {