jewel-box exhibition of some 30 works that opened July 27 and continues through May 11 at the Museum of Fine Arts, Boston.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Audubon’s Words, Worthy of Show', 'kicker': 'Art', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Audubon’s Words, Worthy of Show', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Audubon, John James', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-26T20:10:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randy Kennedy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kennedy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89a1f475-b303-5c91-ade8-d96a07ffd13a', 'word_count': 200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89a1f475-b303-5c91-ade8-d96a07ffd13a'}, {'abstract': 'In a public role that friends say she has been building a lifetime toward, Caroline Kennedy, the “guardian of the flame,” is poised to add to her family’s rich legacy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/fashion/caroline-kennedy-catching-the-torch.html', 'snippet': 'In a public role that friends say she has been building a lifetime toward, Caroline Kennedy, the “guardian of the flame,” is poised to add to her family’s rich legacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some version of this occurs almost everywhere Caroline Kennedy goes.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/fashion/28COVER_SPAN/28COVER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'le