uss flaccid indie rockers, transcendent rappers, R. Kelly and other stars of the Pitchfork Music Festival in Chicago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2013/07/26/arts/music/26popcast_pod.html', 'snippet': 'Ben Ratliff and Jon Caramanica discuss flaccid indie rockers, transcendent rappers, R. Kelly and other stars of the Pitchfork Music Festival in Chicago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ben Ratliff and Jon Caramanica discuss flaccid indie rockers, transcendent rappers, R. Kelly and other stars of the Pitchfork Music Festival in Chicago.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pitchfork Post-Mortem', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-26T20:56:14+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/1d526a0b-ac8a-5501-8865-e9ba045fac9a', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/1d526a0b-ac8a-5501-8865-e9ba045fac9a'}, {'abstract': 'Michelle Dorrance and company stretched tap to its limits in a performance at the Jacob’s Pillow Dance Festival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/27/arts/dance/michelle-dorrance-in-the-blues-project-at-jacobs-pillow.html', 'snippet': 'Michelle Dorrance and company stretched tap to its limits in a performance at the Jacob’s Pillow Dance Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BECKET, Mass. — One way to distinguish American tap dance and Appalachian clogging from their British and Irish relatives is to watch a dancer’s waist. In British and Irish dancers, the hips lift and fall; in Americans, they sink and resurface, as in some African dance. And in the gifted American tap dancer Michelle Dorrance, the sinking is especially pronounced. She drops very low. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank'