einer-scandal-eclipses-issues-in-race.html', 'snippet': 'Bill de Blasio seems to be the most vocal of the Democratic candidates in pressing for a return to the issues of running New York City.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week we learned more about what Anthony D. Weiner was doing after he resigned from Congress, and despite his new fatherhood he wasn’t spending all his time debating sleep training. Instead, Mr. Weiner was bringing shame to the world of epistolary eroticism while apparently never missing a cycle of laundry. On Wednesday, People magazine released outtakes from its interview last year with Huma Abedin, in which she claimed that she was the envy of her friends because she never had to wash a piece of clothing. “I have not been to our dry cleaner,” she said, leaving us to wonder whether Mr. Weiner wasn’t such a literalist that he would pursue stain removal as a means of moral absolution.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/nyregion/28BIGCITY2/28BIGCITY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/28/nyregion/28BIGCITY2/28BIGCITY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/nyregion/28BIGCITY2/28BIGCITY2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/nyregion/28BIGCITY2/28BIGCITY2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1291, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/nyregion/28BIGCITY