 mayor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elsie McCabe Thompson has been out on the campaign trail with her husband before, so her presence at a couple of campaign events on Friday should not have been unusual.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/27/nyregion/trailside-1/trailside-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/27/nyregion/trailside-1/trailside-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/27/nyregion/trailside-1/trailside-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/27/nyregion/trailside-1/trailside-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/27/nyregion/trailside-1/trailside-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/27/nyregion/trailside-1/trailside-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/27/nyregion/trailside-1/trailside-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Thompson’s Wife Hits the Trail, Solo', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Candidate’s Wife\r\nTakes the Stage, Solo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Naggar, Mona el-', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, William C Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, Elsie McCabe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weiner, Anthony D', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-27T00:47:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mona El-Naggar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mona', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'El-Naggar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e2f6e0e-8ff9-5a71-a0c2-c1dd54524aa3', 'word_count': 668, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e2f6e0e-8ff9-5a71-a0c2-c1dd54524aa3'}, {'abstract': 'With at least 18 shows over four days, the Hudson Valley Jazz Festival’s program has broad appeal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/nyregion/expanding-musically-and-geographically.html', 'snippet': 'With at least 18 shows over four days, the Hudson Valley Jazz Festival’s program has broad appeal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the saxophonist David Liebman unwinds onstage, he unleashes waves of sound that recall his days with Miles Davis in the early 1970s. Offstage, he’s a bit more subdued. Sipping a beer after a volatile set at the Greenwich Village club Smalls last month, he mused about Expansions, his first new band in 23 years — and the one he will bring to the Hudson Valley Jazz Festival next month. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/nyregion/28ARTSWE1_SPAN/28ARTSWE1-articl