tions and resonant images. That she has done so is impressive.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on Saturday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Saturday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-27T05:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a95ea01-9d77-530d-be5d-10ef36ab0e6a', 'word_count': 752, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a95ea01-9d77-530d-be5d-10ef36ab0e6a'}, {'abstract': 'The Egyptian authorities unleashed a ferocious attack on Islamist protesters, killing at least 72 people in the second mass killing of demonstrators in three weeks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/world/middleeast/egypt.html', 'snippet': 'The Egyptian authorities unleashed a ferocious attack on Islamist protesters, killing at least 72 people in the second mass killing of demonstrators in three weeks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — The Egyptian authorities unleashed a ferocious attack on Islamist protesters early Saturday, killing at least 72 people in the second mass killing of demonstrators in three weeks and the deadliest attack by the security services since Egypt’s uprising in early 2011.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Crackdown in Egypt Kills Islamists as They Protest', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Egypt’s Ruling Military Kills Scores of Islamists at Rally', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value':