 'uri': 'nyt://article/45bf3766-a199-53d7-b0e3-d8427e89e98e'}, {'abstract': 'Lydia Davis, Carl Hiaasen, Anne Lamott, Rebecca Skloot and others on their hypothetical pen names.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/27/a-writer-by-any-other-name/', 'snippet': 'Lydia Davis, Carl Hiaasen, Anne Lamott, Rebecca Skloot and others on their hypothetical pen names.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After J. K. Rowling admitted that she, and not a military veteran named “Robert Galbraith,” wrote the new mystery novel “The Cuckoo’s Calling,” The New York Times asked several writers to choose a hypothetical pen name and describe what kind of book they might write under — or perhaps behind — that name. (Note: This informal survey was conducted before any of them had a chance to consider “Carlos Danger” as an option.)', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Writer by Any Other Name', 'kicker': 'Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Writer By Any Other Name', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-07-27T18:35:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Draft Contributors', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Draft', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Contributors', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56cb2c2b-563f-5d0b-b29a-88d30d1481d7', 'word_count': 623, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56cb2c2b-563f-5d0b-b29a-88d30d1481d7'}, {'abstract': 'Notable quotes from business articles that appeared in The New York Times last week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/business/the-chatter-for-sunday-july-28.html', 'snippet': 'Notable quotes from business articles that appeared in The New York Times last week.', 'lead_paragraph': '“When so many people from a single hedge fund ha