07/28/science/strong-support-for-labeling-modified-foods.html', 'snippet': 'Americans overwhelmingly support labeling foods that have been genetically modified or engineered, according to a New York Times poll conducted this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Americans overwhelmingly support labeling foods that have been genetically modified or engineered, according to a New York Times poll conducted this year, with 93 percent of respondents saying that foods containing such ingredients should be identified.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Strong Support for Labeling Modified Foods', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Strong Support for Labeling Modified Foods', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetic Engineering', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-27T20:25:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allison Kopicki', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allison', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kopicki', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/848fa698-c7e0-5963-9152-7d4ada805f59', 'word_count': 291, 'uri': 'nyt://article/848fa698-c7e0-5963-9152-7d4ada805f59'}, {'abstract': 'The methodology behind the latest New York Times Poll on genetic modification.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/science/how-the-poll-on-genetic-modification-was-conducted.html', 'snippet': 'The methodology behind the latest New York Times Poll on genetic modification.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York Times poll was based on telephone interviews conducted Jan. 24-27 with 1,052 adults throughout the United States. The sample of land-line telephone exchanges called was randomly selected by a computer from a complete list of more than 72,000 active residential exchanges across the country. The exchanges were chosen so as to ensure that each region of the country was represented in proportion to its share of all telephone numbers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How the Poll on Genetic Modification Was Conducted', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetic Engineering', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oranges', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-27T20:30:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b332558b-fe38-5161-bd57-738ab847b745', 'word_count': 330, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b332558b-fe38-5161-bd57-738ab847b745'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Cale’s blues-inflected rock influenced some of the genre’s biggest names, and his songs were recorded by Eric Clapton and Johnny Cash among others.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/arts/music/jj-cale-musician-and-songwriter-dies-at-74.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cale’s blues-inflected rock influenced some of the genre’s biggest names, and his songs were recorded by Eric Clapton and Johnny Cash among others.', 'lead_paragraph': 'J. J. Cale, a musician and songwriter whose blues-inflected rock influenced some of the genre’s biggest names and whose songs were recorded by Eric Clapton and Johnny Cash, among others, died on Friday in the La Jolla neighborhood of San Diego. He was 74.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/obituaries/28Cale_Obit/28Cale_Obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 866, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/28/obituaries/28Cale_Obit/28Cale_Obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 866}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/obituaries/28Cale_Obit/28Cale_Obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 710, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/obituaries/28Cale_Obit/28Cale_Obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1385, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/obituaries/28Cale_Obit/28Cale_Obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/28/obituaries/28Cale_Obit/28Cale_Obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/obituaries/28Cale_Obit/28Cale_Obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'J. J. Cale, 74, Musician and Songwriter, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'J. J. Cale, 74, Musician and Songwriter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cale, J J (1938-2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-27T20:34:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/1dd2b340-14f4-571c-a996-51c64d69ec0c', 'word_count': 376, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1dd2b340-14f4-571c-a996-51c64d69ec0c'}, {'abstract': 'Saad Mohseni has brought soap operas, sitcoms and reality TV to his native country, Afghanistan, and with them a modicum of normalcy. Now he is looking to expand to Egypt, Libya and Iraq.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/business/an-afghan-media-mogul-pushing-boundaries.html', 'snippet': 'Saad Mohseni has brought soap operas, sitcoms and reality TV to his native country, Afghanistan, and with them a modicum of normalcy. Now he is looking to expand to Egypt, Libya and Iraq.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AT the inaugural championship of the new Afghan premier soccer league in Kabul last October, Saad Mohseni stood on the well-groomed sideline wearing a Western blazer and a toothy smile that said, “Yes, you had better believe it.”', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/business/AFGHANTVCOVER1-sub/AFGHANTVCOVER1-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/28/business/AFGHANTVCOVER1-sub/AFGHANTVCOVER1-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/28/business/AFGHANTVCOVER1-sub/AFGHANTVCOVER1-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 646, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'ju