88954980-1543-5baa-96b0-0258a76539ec'}, {'abstract': '“We’ve Been There Done That,” a program that began at the Harris County Jail last year, aims to help prisoners avoid returning to lives of homelessness and prostitution.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/us/after-prostitution-charges-a-rehab-course-in-self-esteem.html', 'snippet': '“We’ve Been There Done That,” a program that began at the Harris County Jail last year, aims to help prisoners avoid returning to lives of homelessness and prostitution.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — In the women’s block of the Harris County Jail, 20 women who share a dormitory cell openly discussed their past and belted out simple affirmations as part of an exercise.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Prostitution Charges, a Rehab Course in Self-Esteem', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Prostitution Charges, a Rehab Course in Self-Esteem', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Griffin, Kathryn', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prostitution', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Houston (Tex)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homeless Persons', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-27T22:22:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alana Rocha', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rocha', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/51c61fd0-9305-5b0b-851f-54d109d5fe53', 'word_count': 688, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51c61fd0-9305-5b0b-851f-54d109d5fe53'}, {'abstract': 'After years of financing colleges based on the number of students enrolled, the amount of money Texas gives to technical colleges will be based solely on former students’ earnings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/28/us/makeover-for-technical-colleges-based-on-graduates-earnings.html', 'snippet': 'After years of financing colleges based on the number of students enrolled, the amount of money Texas gives to technical colleges will be based solely on former students’ earnings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SWEETWATER — Striking a tone that has become increasingly fashionable among Texas politicians, House Speaker Joe Straus urged his fellow lawmakers at the outset of this year’s legislative session to “expand opportunity in Texas this session by improving coordination among high schools, community and technical colleges and the private sector so that no young person feels destined to spend life drifting from one low-skilled, minimum-wage job to the next.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/us/tt26ENROLL/tt26ENROLL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 344, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/26/us/tt26ENROLL/tt26ENROLL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 344}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/us/tt26ENROLL/tt26ENROLL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 587, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/us/tt26ENROLL/tt26ENROLL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1174, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image