th music by Elliot Goldenthal. Previews are set to begin on Oct. 19 with opening night scheduled for Nov. 2.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Theater for a New Audience Sets Full Season at New Home', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '2 More Plays Added For a Troupe’s New Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taymor, Julie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Theater for a New Audience', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-28T22:07:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/976497df-6741-5f0c-ab7b-83e9f5260781', 'word_count': 144, 'uri': 'nyt://article/976497df-6741-5f0c-ab7b-83e9f5260781'}, {'abstract': 'An intelligence official said that a senior commander in a Pakistan Taliban faction was among those killed in the attack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/29/world/asia/us-drone-strike-kills-at-least-6-in-pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'An intelligence official said that a senior commander in a Pakistan Taliban faction was among those killed in the attack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISLAMABAD, Pakistan—At least six militants were killed and four others injured after the latest American drone strike in Pakistan’s restive tribal belt on Sunday, Pakistani intelligence officials and militant commanders said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Drone Strike Kills at Least 6 in Pakistan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'n