3b0'}, {'abstract': 'In a single day we use dozens of apps to pay for things, check the weather and set up appointments. Here is a list of the apps Nick Bilton uses throughout a single day.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/29/a-day-in-the-life-of-my-iphone/', 'snippet': 'In a single day we use dozens of apps to pay for things, check the weather and set up appointments. Here is a list of the apps Nick Bilton uses throughout a single day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each morning at 7 a.m., I am awakened by the sound of a spaceship next to my bed. I reach my arm from under the covers, flail around blindly looking for my glasses, then grab my iPhone to silence my alarm. But it’s not any normal alarm clock; it’s an app, Walk Up!, which requires you to get up and walk around until the alarm stops its annoying blares.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/technology/bits-app/bits-app-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/technology/bits-app/bits-app-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/technology/bits-app/bits-app-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/26/technology/bits-app/bits-app-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/26/technology/bits-app/bits-app-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Day in the Life of My iPhone', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bilton, Nick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Foursquare', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lyft Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rdio', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Side.Cr LLC', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Uber Technologies Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-29T13:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fac4aa4e-ccf4-5b04-aa7e-6320d890f2ce', 'word_count': 863, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fac4aa4e-ccf4-5b04-aa7e-6320d890f2ce'}, {'abstract': 'América Móvil has freed itself to raise its stake KPN, the former Dutch mobile phone monopoly, a move that could potentially block a deal with Telefónica of Spain.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/07/29/amrica-mvil-maneuvers-to-potentially-raise-stake-in-dutch-operator/', 'snippet': 'América Móvil has freed itself to raise its stake KPN, the former Dutch mobile phone monopoly, a move that could potentially block a deal with Telefónica of Spain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 11:28 a.m. | ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'América Móvil Maneuver