licate nickel-plated handles – but you must tug on them with just enough pressure to flex the handles outward. This effort separates a catch from a door-frame latch; there is no mechanical locking mechanism. The door is now free to open. Inside, to coax the door back into its frame, pull on a leather strap that comes out of the door panel, rather like summoning one’s servant.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/29/automobiles/wheels/voisin-W/voisin-W-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 326, 'width': 581, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/29/automobiles/wheels/voisin-W/voisin-W-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 326, 'width': 581, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/29/automobiles/wheels/voisin-W/voisin-W-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/29/automobiles/wheels/voisin-W/voisin-W-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/29/automobiles/wheels/voisin-W/voisin-W-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Driving a 1935 Avions Voisin C25 Aérodyne', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 3, 'ma