exposure and a $250,000 investment, but was there a better way to raise the money?', 'lead_paragraph': 'A recent episode of “Shark Tank” included a segment on a company called Nuts ‘N More. By all accounts, the company’s appearance was a big success. When the show was taped, the company’s annual sales were about $100,000; they are now on track to hit $1 million. Dennis Iannotti, one of three partners in the company, attributes the growth to the tremendous exposure gained from the show.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reviewing the Deal One Business Made on ‘Shark Tank’', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuban, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-29T17:00:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ami Kassar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ami', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kassar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc5bdd13-c9a6-529f-9d18-082b79ad8f4a', 'word_count': 671, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc5bdd13-c9a6-529f-9d18-082b79ad8f4a'}, {'abstract': 'Designers discuss their work on recent book covers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/07/30/books/30book-covers.html', 'snippet': 'Designers discuss their work on recent book covers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Designers discuss their work on recent book covers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/books/30book-covers-slide-P1WN