9d71'}, {'abstract': 'Scholars who have criticized the historian Howard Zinn’s work defended him against Mitch Daniels, the former governor of Indiana, who called Mr. Zinn’s work “truly execrable.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/29/historians-defend-howard-zinn-against-a-former-governors-critique/', 'snippet': 'Scholars who have criticized the historian Howard Zinn’s work defended him against Mitch Daniels, the former governor of Indiana, who called Mr. Zinn’s work “truly execrable.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 4:18 p.m. | The historian Howard Zinn won a dubious prize of sorts last year when his best-selling “People’s History of the United States” came in second in an informal online poll to determine the “least credible history book in print.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/29/arts/29artsbeat-zinn/29artsbeat-zinn-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 794, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/29/arts/29artsbeat-zinn/29artsbeat-zinn-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 794}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/29/arts/29artsbeat-zinn/29artsbeat-zinn-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 774, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/29/arts/29artsbeat-zinn/29artsbeat-zinn-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1547, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/29/arts/29artsbeat-zinn/29artsbeat-zinn-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'i