203fa6c8'}, {'abstract': 'Simulcasts of WQXR will be heard in Ossining and surrounding areas, thanks to a purchase by New York Public Radio.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/29/more-classical-music-on-the-radio-for-westchester-county/', 'snippet': 'Simulcasts of WQXR will be heard in Ossining and surrounding areas, thanks to a purchase by New York Public Radio.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over-the-air broadcasts of the classical music radio station WQXR are being restored for some Westchester County residents. The station’s parent company, New York Public Radio, on Monday bought the small Ossining radio station WDFH-FM, at 90.3. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Classical Music on the Radio for Westchester County', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WQXR', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Katonah (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ossining (NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-29T20:30:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elizabeth Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1870da7-042f-592f-b323-4854646a44d8', 'word_count': 211, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1870da7-042f-592f-b323-4854646a44d8'}, {'abstract': 'Much remains fuzzy about the case of Celso Heredia, 81, whom the New York police discovered last month disoriented and wandering along a Brooklyn highway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/30/