{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharkey, Joe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Travel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transportation Security Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pistole, John S', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-29T22:52:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Sharkey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sharkey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fbdf17e3-86e5-531e-a89e-dd5d1c86e713', 'word_count': 844, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fbdf17e3-86e5-531e-a89e-dd5d1c86e713'}, {'abstract': 'An opening for the artist Kenny Scharf, which brought out Cindy Sherman, Calvin Klein, Patrick Demarchelier and others, offered a playful respite from the seriousness of the Hamptons party circuit.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/29/about-last-night-hot-rods-and-hot-nights-at-a-hamptons-party-for-kenny-scharf/', 'snippet': 'An opening for the artist Kenny Scharf, which brought out Cindy Sherman, Calvin Klein, Patrick Demarchelier and others, offered a playful respite from the seriousness of the Hamptons party circuit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who“I live in space, but I’m on planet Earth,” Kenny Scharf said. “I don’t want to go live in Mars but in my mind I go there all the time.” The painter, who was the roommate of Keith Haring and a friend of Jean-Michel Basquiat during the “anything goes” days of 1980s New York, was in East Hampton, N.Y., on Saturday for an opening at Eric Firestone Gallery that paired photos of the era by the late Tseng Kwong Chi with Scharf’s own paintings. Spotted at the party were downtown veterans like Bob Colacello; Patrick Demarchelier; Vincent Fremont and his daughter Casey; Calvin Klein, Max Levai, Kyle DeWoody, Lisa Marie Fernandez; and Kembra Pfahler. Cindy Sherman remarked that her friendship with Scharf began in the 1980s, “but I don’t remember how or in what context.” As the proverb goes: if you remember it, you weren’t there.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hot Rods and Hot Nights at a Hamptons Party for Kenny Scharf', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Demarchelier, Patrick', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scharf, Kenny', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sherman, Cindy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-29T23:11:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Baumgardner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baumgardner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd12c669-0d54-57a0-aa08-fa79973cae68', 'word_count': 529, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd12c669-0d54-57a0-aa08-fa79973cae68'}, {'abstract': "Putting aside past acrimony, Harvey Weinstein, the prominent producer, will team with Disney to make a movie adaptation of the book series “Artemis Fowl.’'", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/30/business/media/weinstein-and-disney-together-again.html', 'snippet': "Putting aside past acrimony, Harvey Weinstein, the prominent producer, will team with Disney to make a movie adaptation of the book series “Artemis Fowl.’'", 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Time apparently does heal all wounds: Harvey Weinstein, who bitterly parted ways with the Walt Disney Co