d_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/8d7a26e5-a152-5526-b968-cb862957e58a'}, {'abstract': 'The Food and Drug Administration said an anti-malaria drug, known as Lariam, must update its warning label to show that some of its psychiatric side effects can become permanent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/30/business/fda-strengthens-warnings-on-lariam-anti-malaria-drug.html', 'snippet': 'The Food and Drug Administration said an anti-malaria drug, known as Lariam, must update its warning label to show that some of its psychiatric side effects can become permanent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Food and Drug Administration announced on Monday that a commonly used anti-malaria drug must carry the so-called black box warning on its label because of the danger that the drug could cause serious neurological and psychiatric side effects, some of which can become permanent. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'F.D.A. Strengthens Warnings on Lariam, an Anti-Malaria Drug', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'F.D.A. Strengthens Warnings on Anti-Malaria Drug', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thomas, Katie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Malaria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labeling and Labels', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-29T23:44:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Thomas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thomas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id':