e95-fa0ca33bc236'}, {'abstract': 'The European Union’s top foreign policy official was the most recent person to visit the deposed Egyptian president, who is being held in a secret location.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/31/world/middleeast/egypt.html', 'snippet': 'The European Union’s top foreign policy official was the most recent person to visit the deposed Egyptian president, who is being held in a secret location.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Mohamed Morsi, deposed as president by the Egyptian military on July 3, is in good health, a trickle of visitors allowed access to him and his aides in recent days has revealed. Where he is, however, remains a mystery that has enraged his family and supporters, and aggravated Egypt’s crisis.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/world/middleeast/31egypt1_cnd/31egypt1_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/31/world/middleeast/31egypt1_cnd/31egypt1_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/world/middleeast/31egypt1_cnd/31egypt1_cnd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 627, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/world/middleeast/31egypt1_cnd/31egypt1_cnd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1254, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/world/middleeast/31egypt1_cnd/31egypt1_cnd-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cro