oyne', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e54aab8b-2891-575d-a8ad-29173fb2bdc1', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e54aab8b-2891-575d-a8ad-29173fb2bdc1'}, {'abstract': 'What you need to know for Tuesday: Political candidates at summer concerts, perfect weather, and a new name for a piglet.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/30/new-york-today-live-music-live-voters/', 'snippet': 'What you need to know for Tuesday: Political candidates at summer concerts, perfect weather, and a new name for a piglet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The subway stop meet-and-greet has long been de rigueur for political candidates.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/nyregion/30NYTODAY/30NYTODAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/30/nyregion/30NYTODAY/30NYTODAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/nyregion/30NYTODAY/30NYTODAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/nyregion/30NYTODAY/30NYTODAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/nyregion/30NYTODAY/30NYTODAY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/30/nyregion/30NYTODAY/30NYTODAY-thumbStandard