pet': 'Banco Santander said Tuesday that its second quarter profit jumped to 1.1 billion euros, as the Spanish bank benefited from a fall in charges connected to delinquent loans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON – The Spanish lender Banco Santander posted a sharply higher second-quarter profit of 1.1 billion euros on Tuesday, as it benefited from a fall in charges tied to delinquent loans.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Santander Profit Soars on Lower Charges', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Banco Santander S A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-30T10:36:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba493b47-22fe-5b6c-8501-742b3867e167', 'word_count': 334, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba493b47-22fe-5b6c-8501-742b3867e167'}, {'abstract': 'Among other issues, an owner wonders how much pricing information to disclose. And how much to worry about mobile?', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/30/what-should-i-do-with-my-web-site/', 'snippet': 'Among other issues, an owner wonders how much pricing information to disclose. And how much to worry about mobile?', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have been mulling a project since the beginning of the year — an update of my Web site. There’s nothing exactly wrong with it. We’re getting calls and making sales, and that is the ultimate test of the effectiveness of marketing, but there are aspects of it that I don’t like. Before I make any moves, though, I thought I’d throw my problem out to you and see what wisdom the crowd has to offer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deciding Whether It Is Time to Revamp a Web Site', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search Engines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tables', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Downs, Paul', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paul Downs Cabinetmakers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-30T11:00:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Downs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Downs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/da8936a2-2576-59d5-9073-39fb995ec081', 'word_count': 1172, 'uri': 'nyt://article/da8936a2-2576-59d5-9073-39fb995ec081'}, {'abstract': 'Community Health Systems has agreed to buy Health Management Associates for about $3.6 billion in cash and stock, in a long-expected union of two for-profit hospital systems.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/07/30/h-m-a-to-be-sold-to-community-health-for-3-6-billion/', 'snippet': 'Community Health Systems has agreed to buy Health Management Associates for about $3.6 billion in cash and stock, in a long-expected union of two for-profit hospital systems.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 3:17 p.m. | To include statement from Glenview Capital Management.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia