ber of colleges want to know.', 'print_section': 'ED', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gay Question: Check One', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Gay Question: Check One', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-30T12:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'EdLife', 'section_name': 'Education', 'subsection_name': 'Education Life', 'byline': {'original': 'By Samantha Stainburn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Samantha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stainburn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b400cf5-9436-51ed-81e4-2b5ef2ac3936', 'word_count': 405, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b400cf5-9436-51ed-81e4-2b5ef2ac3936'}, {'abstract': 'For parents of triplets, the exhilaration of doing everything times three, and that includes college graduation, with exclamation points.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/30/booming/the-joy-of-triplets-graduation-one-after-another-after-another.html', 'snippet': 'For parents of triplets, the exhilaration of doing everything times three, and that includes college graduation, with exclamation points.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whenever my wife, Connie, and I mention that we have three children the same age, the common and endearing reaction is: “Triplets. Wow.” And wow, in all good senses of the word, it is.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/booming/30mystory-booming-3grads1/30mystory-booming-3grads1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'lega