c3ffd5'}, {'abstract': 'Telangana will be the 29th state of India after it goes through the legislative process.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/30/congress-party-supports-creation-of-telangana-state/', 'snippet': 'Telangana will be the 29th state of India after it goes through the legislative process.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After years of hunger strikes, sit-ins, and even suicides by activists, India’s ruling Congress party has endorsed the creation of Telangana as the 29th state of India by dividing the southern state of Andhra Pradesh. The Congress Working Committee, the highest body of India’s governing party, passed a resolution Tuesday evening after its allies in the United Progressive Alliance coalition backed the formation of the new state.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/world/asia/30-telengana-IndiaInk/30-telengana-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/30/world/asia/30-telengana-IndiaInk/30-telengana-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/world/asia/30-telengana-IndiaInk/30-telengana-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/world/asia/30-telengana-IndiaInk/30-telengana-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/30/world/asia/30-telengana-IndiaInk/30-telengana-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width'