agraph': 'WASHINGTON — Nearly half a million people who receive food stamps but still do not get enough to eat would lose their eligibility for the program under proposed cuts that are expected to be taken up again by Congress. An additional 160,000 to 305,000 recipients who do get enough to eat would also lose their eligibility and the ability to adequately feed themselves.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'House Plan on Food Stamps Would Cut 5 Million From Program', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'House Republican Proposal Would Cut Food Stamps For 5 Million, Study Finds', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Stamps', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nixon, Ron', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poverty', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Farm Bill (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Health Impact Project', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-30T21:00:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Nixon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nixon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5877bae1-f79b-5a28-a51f-19c807ff624d', 'word_count': 616, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5877bae1-f79b-5a28-a51f-19c807ff624d'}, {'abstract': 'Festival TBD: Emergency Glitter shows how a generation of choreographers is embracing pop culture and pushing dance beyond its conventions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/31/arts/dance/the-margins-of-a-form-are-increasingly-not-where-they-used-to-be.html', 'snippet': 'Festival TBD: Emergency Glitter shows how a generation of choreographers is embracing pop culture and pushing dance beyond its conventions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like any artistic endeavor, Festival TBD: Emergency Glitter, presented last weekend at Abrons Arts Center, had its high and low points. But this brief yet packed event created by the intrepid Ben Pryor came at the right time to show how a generation of choreographers is embracing pop culture and pushing dance beyond its conventions.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/arts/subtrends/subtrends-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/07/31/arts/subtrends/subtrends-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/arts/subtrends/subtrends-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/arts/subtrends/subtrends-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/arts/subtrends/subtrends-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/07/31/arts/subtrends/subtrends-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31/arts/subtrends/subtrends-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, '