ept the borough president’s views, but they usually listen. During Mr. Stringer’s six-and-a-half years in office, he has often charted a reasonable middle way for developments in his borough.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mr. Stringer’s Choice', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mr. Stringer’s Choice', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stringer, Scott M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Midtown Area (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Zoning', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Area Planning and Renewal', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grand Central Terminal (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate (Commercial)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-31T00:58:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1994343-cd07-5b81-aa05-1ffe3db6ea28', 'word_count': 380, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1994343-cd07-5b81-aa05-1ffe3db6ea28'}, {'abstract': 'As Egypt struggles over its future, President Obama needs to state clearly what America stands for.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/07/31/opinion/egypts-dangerous-slide.html', 'snippet': 'As Egypt struggles over its future, President Obama needs to state clearly what America stands for.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Deadly blundering by Egypt’s military rulers is making a bad situation much worse.