ator Mark Pryor, one of 2014’s most vulnerable Democrats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Representative Tom Cotton, Republican of Arkansas, is expected to announce his challenge to Senator Mark Pryor of Arkansas in 2014, according to two Republicans familiar with his thinking. For Mr. Pryor, a two-term Democrat, the bid would further complicate his efforts to hold onto his already vulnerable seat. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rising G.O.P. Star Expected to Challenge Arkansas Democrat', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cotton, Tom', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pryor, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARKANSAS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-07-31T17:34:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7870e03e-7dd7-542d-9c47-8eaee86a26fe', 'word_count': 514, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7870e03e-7dd7-542d-9c47-8eaee86a26fe'}, {'abstract': 'Women in Andhra Pradesh welcome the central government’s endorsement of the creation of Telangana as a separate state.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/07/31/image-of-the-day-july-31-2/', 'snippet': 'Women in Andhra Pradesh welcome the central government’s endorsement of the creation of Telangana as a separate state.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/07/31