, 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/01/greathomesanddestinations/welcome-to-summer-camp.html', 'snippet': 'The bunk-bed aesthetic appeals to design-minded guests. So does the well-stocked vintage bar cart.', 'lead_paragraph': 'George Yabu and Glenn Pushelberg’s beach house has a cantilevered construction, complicated sliding-glass doors made in Germany and a clever push-button dumbwaiter, but the element that best captures its spirit are the playful wood lockers. Lined in a row opposite a wall of bunk beds in a small downstairs room, the lockers suggest a summer camp for design-minded adults and practically scream “houseguests welcome.” ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/garden/01LOCATION2_SPAN/LOC-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/01/garden/01LOCATION2_SPAN/LOC-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/garden/01LOCATION2_SPAN/LOC-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/garden/01LOCATION2_SPAN/LOC-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/garden/01LOCATION2_SPAN/LOC-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/01/garden/01LOCATION2_SPAN/LOC-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'